#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:2
msgid "You can manage actions on your clients in a number of different ways."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, you can schedule automated recurring actions to apply the "
"highstate or an arbitrary set of custom states to clients on a specified "
"schedule.  You can apply recurring actions to individual clients, to all "
"clients in a system group, or to an entire organization."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On both Salt and traditional clients, you can set actions to be performed in "
"a particular order by creating action chains.  Action chains can be created "
"and edited ahead of time, and scheduled to run at a time that suits you."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can also perform remote commands on one or more of your Salt clients.  "
"Remote commands allows you to issue commands to individual Salt clients, or "
"to all clients that match a search term."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can apply recurring actions on individual Salt clients, to a system "
"group, or to all clients in an organization."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Currently, {productname} supports the following action types as recurring "
"actions:"
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, {productname} ຮອງຮັບປະເພດການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຮູບແບບການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:9
msgid "[parameter]``Highstate:`` Execute the highstate."
msgstr "[parameter]``Highstate:`` ປະມວນຜົນ highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:10
msgid ""
"[parameter]``Custom state:`` Execute a set of custom states. A custom state "
"can be either an internal state provided by {productname}, or a "
"configuration channel created by a user."
msgstr "[parameter]``Custom state:`` ປະມວນຜົນຊຸດຂອງສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດເອງອາດເປັນທັງ ສະຖານະພາຍໃນທີ່ {productname} ມີໃຫ້, ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about configuration channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Recurring Action"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To apply a recurring action to an individual client, navigate to "
"[guimenu]``Systems``, click the client to configure schedules for, and "
"navigate to the [guimenu]``Recurring Actions`` tab."
msgstr "ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະໄຄລແອນ, ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems``, ຄລິກເລືອກໄຄລແອນ ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າກຳນົດເວລາ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Recurring Actions``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To apply a recurring action to a system group, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[System Groups], select the group to configure schedules for, "
"and navigate to [guimenu]``Recurring Actions`` tab."
msgstr "ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Groups], ເລືອກກຸ່ມທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າກຳນົດເວລາ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Recurring Actions``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:15
msgid "Click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:16
msgid "Select an action type from the [guimenu]``Action Type`` dropdown."
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດການດຳເນີນການຈາກລາຍການ [guimenu]``Action Type``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:17
msgid "Type a name for the new schedule."
msgstr "ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບການກຳນົດເວລາໃໝ່ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:18
msgid "Choose the frequency of the recurring action:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:19
msgid "[guimenu]``Hourly:`` Type the minute of each hour."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Hourly:`` ພິມນາທີຂອງແຕ່ລະຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For example, [parameter]``15`` runs the action at fifteen minutes past every "
"hour."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, [parameter]``15`` ຈະເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການໃນນາທີທີ 15 ຂອງທຸກໆຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:21
msgid "[guimenu]``Daily:`` Select the time of each day."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Daily:`` ເລືອກເວລາຂອງແຕ່ລະວັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For example, [parameter]``01:00`` runs the action at 0100 every day, in the "
"timezone of the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, [parameter]``01:00`` ຈະເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການໃນເວລາ 01:00 ຂອງທຸກໆວັນ, ຕາມເຂດເວລາຂອງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:23
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Weekly:`` Select the day of the week and the time of the day, to "
"execute the action every week at the specified time."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Weekly:`` ເລືອກວັນໃນອາທິດ ແລະ ເວລາ ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການໃນທຸກໆອາທິດຕາມເວລາທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:24
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Monthly:`` Select the day of the month and the time of the day, "
"to execute the action every month at the specified time."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Monthly:`` ເລືອກວັນໃນເດືອນ ແລະ ເວລາ ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການໃນທຸກໆເດືອນຕາມເວລາທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:25
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Custom Quartz format:`` For more detailed options, enter a custom "
"quartz string."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Custom Quartz format:`` ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຮູບແບບ quartz."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For example, to run a recurring action at 0215 every Saturday of every "
"month, enter:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການໃນເວລາ 02:15 ທຸກໆວັນເສົາຂອງທຸກໆເດືອນ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "0 15 2 ? * 7\n"
msgstr "0 15 2 ? * 7\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:28
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Toggle the [guimenu]``Test mode`` switch on to run the schedule in "
"test mode."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເປີດສະວິດ [guimenu]``Test mode`` ເພື່ອລອງໃຊ້ງານການກຳນົດເວລາໃນໂໝດທົດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For actions of type [parameter]``Custom state``, select the states from the "
"list of available states and click btn:[Save Changes]. This will only save "
"the current state selection and not the schedule."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການປະເພດ [parameter]``Custom state``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສະຖານະຈາກລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save Changes]. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະບັນທຶກພຽງແຕ່ສະຖານະທີ່ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກການກຳນົດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the next pane, drag and drop the selected states to put them in the "
"execution order and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ລາກ ແລະ ວາງສະຖານະທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເພື່ອຈັດລຳດັບການເຮັດວຽກ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Finally, click btn:[Create Schedule] to save, and see the complete list of "
"existing schedules."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Organization Administrators can set and edit recurring actions for all "
"clients in the organization.  Navigate to menu:Home[My Organization > "
"Recurring Actions] to see all recurring actions that apply to the entire "
"organization."
msgstr "ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານອົງກອນສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນສຳລັບທຸກໄຄລແອນໃນອົງກອນໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Home[My Organization > Recurring Actions] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນທັງໝົດ ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ທັງອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:33
msgid ""
"{productname} Administrators can set and edit recurring actions for all "
"clients in all organizations.  Navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations], select "
"the organization to manage, and navigate to the menu:States[Recurring "
"Actions] tab."
msgstr "ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ {productname} ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳຄືນສຳລັບທຸກໄຄລແອນໃນທຸກອົງກອນໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Organizations], ເລືອກອົງກອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການບໍລິຫານຈັດການ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:States[Recurring Actions]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Recurring actions can only be used with Salt clients.  Traditional clients "
"in your group or organization are ignored."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action Chains"
msgstr "ຊຸດຂອງການດຳເນີນການ (Action Chains)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:36
msgid ""
"If you need to perform a number of sequential actions on your clients, you "
"can create an action chain to ensure the order is respected."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການປະຕິບັດຫຼາຍການດຳເນີນການຕາມລຳດັບໃຫ້ກັບໄຄລແອນ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊຸດຂອງການດຳເນີນການ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຈະມີການເຮັດວຽກຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:37
msgid ""
"By default, most clients execute an action as soon as the command is "
"issued.  In some case, actions take a long time, which could mean that "
"actions issued afterwards fail.  For example, if you instruct a client to "
"reboot, then issue a second command, the second action could fail because "
"the reboot is still occurring.  To ensure that actions occur in the correct "
"order, use action chains."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ໄຄລແອນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການທັນທີເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບຄຳສັ່ງ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ການດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງ ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ສົ່ງຕາມຫຼັງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກທ່ານສັ່ງໃຫ້ໄຄລແອນ reboot ແລ້ວສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງທີສອງທັນທີ, ຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນອາດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຍ້ອນລະບົບຍັງ reboot ບໍ່ທັນແລ້ວ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການດຳເນີນການຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊຸດຂອງການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:38
msgid ""
"For transactional update systems, an action chain is executed inside a "
"single snapshot, until there is a reboot action.  This can cause some "
"limitations."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ມີການອັບເດດແບບ transactional, ຊຸດຂອງການດຳເນີນການຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນພາຍໃນ snapshot ດຽວ, ຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການດຳເນີນການ reboot. ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:39
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:72
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:73
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:40
msgid ""
"You can use action chains on both traditional and Salt clients.  Action "
"chains can include any number of these actions, in any order:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:41
msgid "menu:System Details[Remote Command]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Remote Command]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:42
msgid "menu:System Details[Schedule System Reboot]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Schedule System Reboot]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:43
msgid "menu:System Details[States > Highstate]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[States > Highstate]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:44
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > List/Remove]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > List/Remove]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:45
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Install]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Install]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:46
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Upgrade]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Upgrade]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:47
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Patches]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Patches]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:48
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:49
msgid "menu:System Details[Configuration]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Configuration]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:50
msgid "menu:Images[Build]"
msgstr "menu:Images[Build]"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Action Chain"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊຸດການດຳເນີນການໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the first action you want to "
"perform in the action chain.  For example, navigate to [guimenu]``System "
"Details`` for a client, and click btn:[Schedule System Reboot]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ການດຳເນີນການທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃສ່ໃນຊຸດການດຳເນີນການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``System Details`` ຂອງໄຄລແອນ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Schedule System Reboot]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Add to`` field and select the action chain you want to "
"add to:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Add to`` ແລ້ວເລືອກຊຸດການດຳເນີນການທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມໃສ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:54
msgid "If this is your first action chain, select ``new action chain``."
msgstr "ຫາກນີ້ແມ່ນຊຸດການດຳເນີນການທຳອິດຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``new action chain``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:55
msgid "If the action chain already exists, select it from the list."
msgstr "ຫາກມີຊຸດການດຳເນີນການຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If you already have existing action chains, but you want to create a new "
"action chain, start typing a name for the new action chain to create it."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານມີຊຸດການດຳເນີນການຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງການສ້າງອັນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຊຸດການດຳເນີນການໃໝ່ເພື່ອສ້າງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:57
msgid "Confirm the action."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:58
msgid ""
"The action is not performed immediately, it creates the new action chain, "
"and a blue bar confirming this appears at the top of the screen."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການຈະຍັງບໍ່ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກທັນທີ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະສ້າງຊຸດການດຳເນີນການໃໝ່ຂຶ້ນມາ, ແລະ ຈະມີແຖບສີຟ້າປາກົດຂຶ້ນທີ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Continue adding actions to your action chain by checking the [guimenu]``Add "
"to`` field and selecting the name of the action chain to add them to."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການດຳເນີນການອື່ນໆ ໃສ່ໃນຊຸດການດຳເນີນການຂອງທ່ານຕໍ່ໄປ ໂດຍການກວດເບິ່ງຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Add to`` ແລະ ເລືອກຊື່ຊຸດການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:60
msgid ""
"When you have finished adding actions, navigate to menu:Schedule[Action "
"Chains] and selecting the action chain from the list."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເພີ່ມການດຳເນີນການສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Action Chains] ແລ້ວເລືອກຊຸດການດຳເນີນການຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Re-order actions by dragging them and dropping them into the correct "
"position."
msgstr "ຈັດລຳດັບການດຳເນີນການໃໝ່ໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງລົງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Click the blue plus sign to see the clients an action is to be performed "
"on.  Click btn:[Save] to save your changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກສີຟ້າເພື່ອເບິ່ງໄຄລແອນທີ່ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Schedule a time for your action chain to run, and click btn:[Save and "
"Schedule]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຊຸດການດຳເນີນການເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save and Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:64
msgid ""
"If you leave the page without clicking either btn:[Save] or btn:[Save and "
"Schedule] all unsaved changes are discarded."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານອອກຈາກໜ້າເວັບໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ຫຼື btn:[Save and Schedule], ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນບັນທຶກທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:65
msgid ""
"If one action in an action chain fails, the action chain stops, and no "
"further actions are executed."
msgstr "ຫາກມີການດຳເນີນການໃດໜຶ່ງໃນຊຸດການດຳເນີນການຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ຊຸດການດຳເນີນການນັ້ນຈະຢຸດທັນທີ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:66
msgid ""
"You can see scheduled actions from action chains by navigating to "
"menu:Schedule[Pending Actions]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຈາກຊຸດການດຳເນີນການໄດ້ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Pending Actions]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote Commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ (Remote Commands)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:68
msgid ""
"You can configure clients to run commands remotely.  This allows you to "
"issue scripts or individual commands to a client, without having access to "
"the client directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:69
msgid ""
"This feature is automatically enabled on Salt clients, and you do not need "
"to perform any further configuration.  For traditional clients, the feature "
"is enabled if you have registered the client using a bootstrap script and "
"have enabled remote commands.  You can use this procedure to enable it "
"manually, instead."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure your client is subscribed to the appropriate tools "
"child channel for its installed operating system.  For more information "
"about subscribing to software channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channel) ຂອງເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:71
msgid ""
"For transactional update systems, consider that a remote command is run "
"inside a single snapshot.  This can cause some limitations."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Traditional Clients to Accept Remote Commands"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:75
msgid ""
"On the client, at the command prompt, use the package manager to install the "
"[systemitem]``rhncfg``, [systemitem]``rhncfg-client``, and "
"[systemitem]``rhncfg-actions`` packages, if not already installed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:76
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:130
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:51
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:12
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:17
#: modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:22
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:9
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in rhncfg rhncfg-client rhncfg-actions\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:78
msgid ""
"On the client, at the command prompt, as root, create a path in the local "
"configuration directory:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir -p /etc/sysconfig/rhn/allowed-actions/script\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:80
msgid "Create an empty file called [path]``run`` in the new directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:81
msgid "This file grants the {productname} Server permission to run remote commands:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "touch /etc/sysconfig/rhn/allowed-actions/script/run\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:83
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, remote commands are run from the [path]``/tmp/`` directory "
"on the client.  To ensure that remote commands work accurately, do not mount "
"``/tmp`` with the [parameter]``noexec`` option.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:84
msgid ""
"All commands run from the [guimenu]``Remote Commands`` page are executed as "
"{rootuser} on clients.  Wildcards can be used to run commands across any "
"number of systems.  Always take extra care to check your commands before "
"issuing them."
msgstr "ທຸກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ລັນຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Remote Commands`` ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນນາມ {rootuser} ໃນໄຄລແອນ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ Wildcards ເພື່ອລັນຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາຫຼາຍລະບົບພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ຄວນລະມັດລະວັງ ແລະ ກວດສອບຄຳສັ່ງໃຫ້ດີ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງອອກໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running Remote Commands on Traditional Clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to run a remote command on, and navigate to the menu:Details[Remote "
"Command] tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:87
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Run as user`` field, type the user ID (UID) of the user on "
"the client that you want to run the command."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:88
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can specify a group to run the command, using the group "
"ID (GID) in the [guimenu]``Run as group`` field."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:89
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: In the [guimenu]``Timeout`` field, type a timeout period for the "
"command, in seconds."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:90
msgid "If the command is not executed within this period, it is not run."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:91
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Command label`` field, type a name for your command."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:92
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Script`` field, type the command or script to execute."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:93
msgid ""
"Select a date and time to execute the command, or add the remote command to "
"an action chain."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:94
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule] to schedule the remote command."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:95
msgid ""
"For more information about action chains, see "
"xref:reference:schedule/action-chains.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running Remote Commands on Salt Clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:97
msgid "Navigate to menu:Salt[Remote Commands]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Salt[Remote Commands]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:98
msgid ""
"In the first field, before the ``@`` symbol, type the command you want to "
"issue."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງທຳອິດ, ກ່ອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``@``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສົ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:99
msgid ""
"In the second field, after the ``@`` symbol, type the client you want to "
"issue the command on."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງທີສອງ, ຫຼັງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``@``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໄຄລແອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:100
msgid ""
"You can type the ``minion-id`` of an individual client, or you can use "
"wildcards to target a range of clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດພິມ ``minion-id`` ຂອງແຕ່ລະໄຄລແອນ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ wildcards ເພື່ອລະບຸຫຼາຍໄຄລແອນພ້ອມກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Find targets] to check which clients you have targeted, and "
"confirm that you have used the correct details."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Find targets] ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າໄຄລແອນໃດແດ່ທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄຳສັ່ງ, ແລະ ຢືນຢັນລາຍລະອຽດໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:102
msgid "Click btn:[Run command] to issue the command to the target clients."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Run command] ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາໄຄລແອນເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/admin-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administration Guide Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/admin-overview.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**ອັບເດດເມື່ອ:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/admin-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This book provides guidance on performing administration tasks on the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compliance as code"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This document provides insight on running compliance as code remediation "
"using an Ansible Playbook."
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມມາດຕະຖານ (remediation) ໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more infomation about running compliance as code remediation using a "
"bash script, see xref:administration:openscap.adoc#remediation[Remediation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມມາດຕະຖານໂດຍໃຊ້ bash script, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:openscap.adoc#remediation[Remediation]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run remediation using an Ansible playbook"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:5
msgid ""
"An Ansible control node is required.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ Ansible control node. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The following procedure will guide you through running remediation using an "
"Ansible Playbook."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Run remediation using an Ansible playbook"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:8
msgid ""
"From the control node system menu select menu:Ansible[Playbooks].  Expand "
"the folder tab, then select a playbook."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:9
msgid "Click the playbook."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  For a list of supported SCAP profiles supported by SUSE, please refer "
"to:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLE 12: https://static.open-scap.org/ssg-guides/ssg-sle12-guide-index.html\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLE 15: https://static.open-scap.org/ssg-guides/ssg-sle15-guide-index.html\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To run the playbook, select the OS **Inventory Path** for the client, for "
"example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
msgstr "/etc/ansible/sles15\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:15
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:84
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:91
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:16
msgid "Check the status of the scheduled event under the [guimenu]``Events`` tab."
msgstr "ກວດສອບສະຖານະຂອງເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັບ [guimenu]``Events``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible integration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Currently, the supported version of Ansible is 2.9 (LTS) shipped in SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise 15 Client Tools channels.  The supported OS version for the "
"Ansible Control Node is {sles} 15 SP3, or later.  Ansible software is also "
"available for {productname} Proxy and {productname} {smr} Branch Server.  "
"For Control Nodes running operating systems other than {sle}, use Ansible "
"shipped together with your distribution."
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ເວີຊັນຂອງ Ansible ທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ 2.9 (LTS) ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບຊ່ອງທາງ SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 Client Tools. ເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Ansible Control Node ແມ່ນ {sles} 15 SP3 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ຊອບແວ Ansible ຍັງມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} {smr} Branch Server. ສຳລັບ Control Node ທີ່ລັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນໆ ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {sle}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Ansible ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຟີເຈີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} enables system administrators to operate their Ansible Control "
"Nodes.  Supported features are:"
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານລະບົບສາມາດໃຊ້ງານ Ansible Control Nodes ຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າໄດ້. ຟີເຈີທີ່ຮອງຮັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:5
msgid "inspection of inventory files"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:6
msgid "discovery of playbooks"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:7
msgid "execution of playbooks"
msgstr "ການລັນ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:8
msgid "For more information:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The inventory is a sorted list of managed Ansible nodes.  For more "
"information about organizing an inventory, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."
msgstr "Inventory ແມ່ນລາຍການທີ່ຈັດລຳດັບຂອງ Ansible nodes ທີ່ຖືກບໍລິຫານຈັດການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການ inventory, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Playbooks are a way to describe how the inventory is to be managed.  For "
"more information about playbooks, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."
msgstr "Playbooks ແມ່ນວິທີການກຳນົດວ່າຈະບໍລິຫານຈັດການ inventory ແນວໃດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ playbooks, ເບິ່ງ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and basic configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:12
msgid ""
"To use Ansible features, you need to register the already existing Ansible "
"Control Node as a Salt client to the {productname} Server.  In the {webui}, "
"on the menu:System Details[Properties] page of the registered system, you "
"must enable the ``Ansible Control Node`` system type of the "
"[guimenu]``Add-on System Types`` list."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Enabling the ``Ansible Control Node`` system type ensures that the "
"[package]``ansible`` package is installed on the system by adding it in the "
"highstate and activates the Ansible features under the menu:System "
"Details[Ansible] tab."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານປະເພດລະບົບ ``Ansible Control Node`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າແພັກເກັດ [package]``ansible`` ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບໂດຍການເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ highstate ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟີເຈີ Ansible ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັບ menu:System Details[Ansible]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"As the next step, configure the paths to your Ansible playbook directories "
"and inventory files on the menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node] "
"page.  As an inventory path, you can use the standard Ansible inventory path "
"[literal]``/etc/ansible/hosts``.  As a playbook directory, you can use any "
"directory on the control node, where your playbook files are stored.  A "
"playbook directory either contains [literal]``.yml`` files or subdirectories "
"with [literal]``.yml`` files."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ Ansible playbook ແລະ ໄຟວ໌ inventory ທີ່ໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node]. ສຳລັບ inventory path, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [literal]``/etc/ansible/hosts``. ສຳລັບ playbook directory, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນ control node ທີ່ເກັບໄຟວ໌ playbook ຂອງທ່ານໄວ້. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ playbook ອາດຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍໄຟວ໌ [literal]``.yml`` ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີໄຟວ໌ [literal]``.yml``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For installing and setting up an Ansible Control Node, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory inspection"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"After defining an inventory path, you can use {productname} to inspect its "
"contents."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ inventory path ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອກວດສອບເນື້ອຫາພາຍໃນນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Inspecting an inventory from the {webui}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Inventories]"
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:System Details[Ansible > Inventories]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Click an inventory path to execute the inventory inspection on the Control "
"Node in real-time."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ inventory path ເພື່ອລັນການກວດສອບ inventory ໃນ Control Node ແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌ (real-time)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook discovery"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:22
msgid ""
"After defining a playbook directory, you can discover playbooks on the "
"menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks] page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ playbook directory ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks ໄດ້ທີ່ໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"As with the inventory inspection, the playbook discovery operations run on "
"the Control Node in real-time."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບການກວດສອບ inventory, ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbook ຈະລັນໃນ Control Node ແບບຣຽວໄທມ໌."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook execution"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can schedule a playbook execution from the menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Playbooks] page.  After selecting the playbook you wish to execute, you can "
"select the inventory file for the execution from the [guimenu]``Inventory "
"Path`` drop-down menu of the [guimenu]``Schedule Playbook Execution`` "
"dialog.  If you do not select any item, the default inventory configured in "
"your Control Node will be used.  The drop-down menu is populated with the "
"inventories you defined in your Inventory paths and with inventories that "
"have been locally discovered in your playbook directories.  These are "
"displayed as [guimenu]``Custom Inventory`` items in the playbook details.  "
"You can also enter an arbitrary inventory path."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາການລັນ playbook ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]. ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກ playbook ທີ່ຕ້ອງການລັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄຟວ໌ inventory ໄດ້ຈາກລາຍການ [guimenu]``Inventory Path`` ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ [guimenu]``Schedule Playbook Execution``. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກອັນໃດ, ລະບົບຈະໃຊ້ inventory ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ Control Node ຂອງທ່ານ. ລາຍການໃນເມນູຈະລວມເອົາ inventory ທີ່ທ່ານລະບຸໄວ້ ແລະ inventory ທີ່ລະບົບຄົ້ນຫາພົບໃນ playbook directories. ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງເປັນລາຍການ [guimenu]``Custom Inventory`` ໃນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງ playbook. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃສ່ inventory path ອື່ນໆ ໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Afterwards, you choose the time of the playbook execution or select an "
"action chain.  Eventually, {productname} executes the playbook as an action "
"on the Control Node.  You can see the result of the operation on the action "
"details page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາກຳນົດລັນ playbook ຫຼື ເລືອກຊຸດການດຳເນີນການ (action chain). ໃນທີ່ສຸດ, {productname} ຈະລັນ playbook ເປັນການດຳເນີນການໜຶ່ງໃນ Control Node. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຜົນຂອງການເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດການດຳເນີນການ (action details)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Ansible control node"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To set up an Ansible control node, execute the following steps from the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible control node, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up an Ansible control node"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products], verify that [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP5 "
"x86_64`` and [literal]``SUSE Manager Client Tools for SLE 15 x86_64`` are "
"selected and synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:5
msgid "Deploy a {sles} 15 SP5 client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the menu:Systems[Overview] page of "
"the client.  Select menu:Software[Software Channels] and subscribe the "
"client to the [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP5 x86_64`` and "
"[literal]``SUSE Manager Client Tools for SLE 15 x86_64`` channels."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:7
msgid "The {productname} client tools contain the [package]``ansible`` package."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Select menu:Details[Properties] of your client.  From the [literal]``Add-On "
"System Types`` list enable [guimenu]``Ansible Control Node`` and click "
"btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ menu:Details[Properties] ຂອງໄຄລແອນ. ຈາກລາຍການ [literal]``Add-On System Types`` ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [guimenu]``Ansible Control Node`` ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to the client overview page, select menu:State[Highstate], and "
"click btn:[Apply Highstate]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າພາບລວມຂອງໄຄລແອນ, ເລືອກ menu:State[Highstate], ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Apply Highstate]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:10
msgid "Select the menu:Events[] tab and verify the status of the highstate."
msgstr "ເລືອກແທັບ menu:Events[] ແລະ ກວດສອບສະຖານະຂອງ highstate."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the SCAP security guide package"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For executing remediations you need to install the SCAP security guide "
"package on the Ansible control node."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການແກ້ໄຂ (remediations) ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide ໃນ Ansible control node."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the SCAP security guide package"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:14
msgid ""
"From menu:Systems[Overview], select the client.  Then click "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install]."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູ menu:Systems[Overview], ເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ menu:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Search for [package]``scap-security-guide`` and install the package suitable "
"for your system.  See the following table for package distribution "
"requirements:"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ. ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການໃນການແຈກຢາຍແພັກເກດ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP security guide package requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງແພັກເກດ SCAP security guide"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package name\n"
"| Supported Systems\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide\n"
"| {opensuse}, SLES12, SLES15\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| CentOS 7, CentOS 8, Fedora, Oracle Linux 7, Oracle Linux 8, RHEL7, RHEL8, "
"RHEL9, Red Hat OpenStack Platform 10, Red Hat OpenStack Platform 13, Red Hat "
"Virtualization 4, Scientific Linux\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-debian\n"
"| Debian 9, Debian 10\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-ubuntu\n"
"|Ubuntu 16.04. Ubuntu 18.04, Ubuntu 20.04\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Ansible inventory files"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Ansible Integration tools deploy a playbook as an inventory file.  Create "
"one inventory file for each operating system listed in _Table 1_."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື Ansible Integration ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ playbook ໃນຮູບແບບໄຟວ໌ inventory. ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟວ໌ inventory ໜຶ່ງໄຟວ໌ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ລະບຸໃນ _ຕາຕະລາງ 1_."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the Ansible inventory files"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Create and add your hosts to an inventory file to be managed by Ansible.  "
"The default path for an Ansible inventory is [path]``/etc/ansible/hosts``."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມ hosts ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນໄຟວ໌ inventory ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Ansible ບໍລິຫານຈັດການ. ເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ Ansible inventory ແມ່ນ [path]``/etc/ansible/hosts``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Inventory"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client240.mgr.example.org\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org "
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/some_ssh_key\n"
msgstr ""
"client240.mgr.example.org\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/some_ssh_key\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mygroup1]\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"[mygroup1]\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mygroup2]\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"[mygroup2]\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[all:vars]\n"
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr ""
"[all:vars]\n"
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, from the [guimenu]``Ansible`` tab navigate to "
"menu:Ansible[Control Node] to add inventory files to the control node."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ຈາກແທັບ [guimenu]``Ansible`` ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Ansible[Control Node] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໄຟວ໌ inventory ເຂົ້າໃນ control node."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Under the [literal]``Playbook Directories`` section add "
"[literal]``/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible`` to the [literal]``Add a "
"Playbook Directories`` field and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກ [literal]``Playbook Directories`` ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [literal]``/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible`` ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Add a Playbook Directories`` ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Under [literal]``Inventory Files`` add your inventory file locations to the "
"[literal]``Add an Inventory file`` field and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ [literal]``Inventory Files`` ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມບ່ອນເກັບໄຟວ໌ inventory ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Add an Inventory file`` ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
"/etc/ansible/sles12\n"
"/etc/ansible/centos7\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
"/etc/ansible/sles12\n"
"/etc/ansible/centos7\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For additional playbook examples, see "
"https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ playbook ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Establish communication with the Ansible nodes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Establishing communication with the Ansible nodes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:35
msgid "Create the SSH keys that you are using in your inventory."
msgstr "ສ້າງ SSH keys ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ໃນ inventory ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -f /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr "ssh-keygen -f /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:37
msgid "Copy the generated SSH keys to the Ansible managed clients.  Example:"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາ SSH keys ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄປຫາ Ansible managed clients. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssh-copy-id -i /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key "
"root@client240.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr "ssh-copy-id -i /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key root@client240.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:39
msgid "Declare the private key in [path]``/etc/ansible/ansible.cfg`` as follows:"
msgstr "ລະບຸ private key ໃນ [path]``/etc/ansible/ansible.cfg`` ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "private_key_file = /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr "private_key_file = /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Replace [path]``my_ansible_private_key`` with the name of the file "
"containing the private key."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [path]``my_ansible_private_key`` ເປັນຊື່ໄຟວ໌ທີ່ມີ private key ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Test that Ansible is working by executing the following commands from the "
"control node:"
msgstr "ທົດສອບວ່າ Ansible ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ control node:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ansible all -m ping\n"
"ansible mygroup1 -m ping\n"
"ansible client240.mgr.example.org -m ping\n"
msgstr ""
"ansible all -m ping\n"
"ansible mygroup1 -m ping\n"
"ansible client240.mgr.example.org -m ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:44
msgid "You may now run remediations."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:45
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#.  bsc#1213077 #9
#.  section on how to create playbooks, and how to schedule their execution.
#.  Add a description of the "Playbooks" tab, in general context.
#.  There is a very summarized descriptions in next section "Compliance as code", but we // need a description of the playbooks tab that is independent of usage with openscap.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Auditing"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ (Auditing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname}, you can keep track of your clients through a series of "
"auditing tasks.  You can check that your clients are up to date with all "
"public security patches (CVEs), perform subscription matching, and use "
"OpenSCAP to check for specification compliance."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຜ່ານຊຸດຂອງວຽກງານການກວດສອບ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ອັບເດດແພັດຄວາມປອດໄພສາທາລະນະ (CVEs) ທັງໝົດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່, ເຮັດການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription matching), ແລະ ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອກວດສອບ ການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດທາງເຕັກນິກ (specification compliance)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Audit`` to perform "
"auditing tasks."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Audit`` ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດວຽກງານການກວດສອບ."

#.  This probably needs to be broken into sub-sections. --LKB 20200205
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Audits"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A CVE (common vulnerabilities and exposures) is a fix for a publicly known "
"security vulnerability."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:6
msgid "You must apply CVEs to your clients as soon as they become available."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງນຳໃຊ້ CVE ໃຫ້ກັບໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານທັນທີທີ່ມີການປ່ອຍອອກມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Each CVE contains an identification number, a description of the "
"vulnerability, and links to further information.  CVE identification numbers "
"use the form ``CVE-YEAR-XXXX``."
msgstr "CVE ແຕ່ລະອັນຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍໝາຍເລກປະຈຳຕົວ, ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຊ່ອງໂຫວ່, ແລະ ລິງກ໌ໄປຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ໝາຍເລກປະຈຳຕົວ CVE ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ ``CVE-ປີ-ເລກລຳດັບ``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Audit[CVE Audit] to see a "
"list of all clients and their current patch status."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[CVE Audit] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການ ໄຄລແອນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ສະຖານະແພັດໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, the CVE data is updated at 2300 every day.  We recommend that "
"before you begin a CVE audit you refresh the data to ensure you have the "
"latest patches."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating CVE Data"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and "
"select the ``cve-server-channels-default`` schedule."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Task Schedules] ແລ້ວເລືອກ ກຳນົດເວລາ ``cve-server-channels-default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[cve-server-channels-bunch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[cve-server-channels-bunch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:13
msgid "Click btn:[Single Run Schedule] to schedule the task."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Single Run Schedule] ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາວຽກງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:14
msgid "Allow the task to complete before continuing with the CVE audit."
msgstr "ຖ້າໃຫ້ວຽກງານສຳເລັດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກວດສອບ CVE ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying Patch Status"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:16
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Audit[CVE Audit]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[CVE Audit]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To check the patch status for a particular CVE, type the CVE identifier in "
"the [guimenu]``CVE Number`` field."
msgstr "ເພື່ອກວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດສຳລັບ CVE ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ພິມໝາຍເລກ CVE ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``CVE Number``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Select the patch statuses you want to look for, or leave all statuses "
"checked to look for all."
msgstr "ເລືອກສະຖານະແພັດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ເລືອກທັງໝົດເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາທຸກສະຖານະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Audit Servers] to check all systems, or click btn:[Audit Images] "
"to check all images."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Audit Servers] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທຸກລະບົບ, ຫຼື ຄລິກ btn:[Audit Images] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທຸກອິມເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information about the patch status icons used on this page, see "
"xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄອຄອນສະຖານະແພັດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໜ້ານີ້, ເບິ່ງ xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For each system, the [guimenu]``Next Action`` column provides information "
"about what you need to do to address vulnerabilities.  If applicable, a list "
"of candidate channels or patches is also given.  You can also assign systems "
"to a [guimenu]``System Set`` for further batch processing."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} API to verify the patch status of your "
"clients.  Use the ``audit.listSystemsByPatchStatus`` API method.  For more "
"information about this method, see the {productname} API Guide."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} API ເພື່ອກວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດຂອງໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ API ``audit.listSystemsByPatchStatus``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເມທອດນີ້, ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມື {productname} API."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The CVE status of clients is usually either ``affected``, ``not affected``, "
"or ``patched``.  These statuses are based only on the information that is "
"available to {productname}."
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE ຂອງໄຄລແອນໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະເປັນ ``affected`` (ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ), ``not affected`` (ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ), ຫຼື ``patched`` (ແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ). ສະຖານະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນອີງຕາມຂໍ້ມູນ ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:25
msgid "Within {productname}, these definitions apply:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ {productname}, ຈະມີຄຳນິຍາມດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "System affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:27
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version lower than the version "
"of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດທີ່ເປັນເວີຊັນຕໍ່າກວ່າເວີຊັນຂອງແພັກເກັດດຽວກັນ ໃນແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເຊິ່ງລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "System not affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:29
msgid ""
"A system which has no installed package that is also in a relevant patch "
"marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ມີແພັກເກດຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງຢູ່ໃນແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "System patched for a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການລົງແພັດສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:31
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version equal to or greater "
"than the version of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the "
"vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ ເຊິ່ງມີເວີຊັນເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າເວີຊັນຂອງແພັກເກດດຽວກັນໃນແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant patch"
msgstr "ແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:33
msgid "A patch known by {productname} in a relevant channel."
msgstr "ແພັດທີ່ {productname} ຮູ້ຈັກຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:35
msgid ""
"A channel managed by {productname}, which is either assigned to the system, "
"the original of a cloned channel which is assigned to the system, a channel "
"linked to a product which is installed on the system or a past or future "
"service pack channel for the system."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບ, ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໂຄນມາເຊິ່ງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບ, ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງ service pack ໃນອະດີດ ຫຼື ອະນາຄົດສຳລັບລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Because of the definitions used within {productname}, CVE audit results "
"might be incorrect in some circumstances.  For example, unmanaged channels, "
"unmanaged packages, or non-compliant systems might report incorrectly."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຳນິຍາມທີ່ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ {productname}, ຜົນການກວດສອບ CVE ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນບາງສະຖານະການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັດການ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັດການ, ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງ ອາດຈະລາຍງານຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With PAM"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports network-based authentication systems using pluggable "
"authentication modules (PAM).  PAM is a suite of libraries that allows you "
"to integrate {productname} with a centralized authentication mechanism, "
"eliminating the need to remember multiple passwords.  {productname} supports "
"LDAP, Kerberos, and other network-based authentication systems using PAM."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In usernames, additionally to alphanumeric characters, [literal]``-``, "
"[literal]``_``, [literal]``.``, and [literal]``@`` are allowed."
msgstr "ໃນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ນອກຈາກຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ຕົວເລກແລ້ວ, ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [literal]``-``, [literal]``_``, [literal]``.``, ແລະ [literal]``@`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling PAM"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Create a PAM service file at [path]``/etc/pam.d/susemanager``.  Filename "
"must be in lower case and readable by ``tomcat`` user.  This file is used by "
"{productname} to load the correct PAM configuration files:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#%PAM-1.0\n"
"auth     include        common-auth\n"
"account  include        common-account\n"
"password include        common-password\n"
"session  include        common-session\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, add the "
"``sss`` PAM module:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "pam-config -a --sss\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This command adds the module to the ``/etc/pam.d/common-auth`` configuration "
"file.  We do not recommend editing this file directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Enforce the use of the service file by adding this line to "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "pam_auth_service = susemanager\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:12
msgid "In this example, the PAM service file is called [systemitem]``susemanager``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:13
msgid "Restart the {productname} services after a configuration change."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Users[Create User] and enable "
"a new or existing user to authenticate with PAM."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Users[Create User] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)`` checkbox.  It "
"is below the password and password confirmation fields."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Changing the password in the {productname} {webui} changes only the local "
"password on the {productname} Server.  If PAM is enabled for that user, the "
"local password might not be used at all.  In the above example, for "
"instance, the Kerberos password is not changed.  Use the password change "
"mechanism of your network service to change the password for these users."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {productname} {webui} ຈະປ່ຽນແປງສະເພາະລະຫັດຜ່ານທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃນ {productname} Server ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ PAM ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານທ້ອງຖິ່ນອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເລີຍ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ເຊັ່ນ: ລະຫັດຜ່ານ Kerberos ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກົນໄກການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To configure system-wide authentication you can use YaST.  You need to "
"install the [package]``yast2-auth-client`` package."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring PAM, the SUSE Linux Enterprise Server "
"Security Guide contains a generic example that also works for other "
"network-based authentication methods.  It also describes how to configure an "
"active directory service.  For more information, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/part-auth.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example SSO Implementation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In this example, SSO is implemented by exposing three endpoints with "
"{productname}, and using Keycloak 21.0.1 or later as the identity service "
"provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, SSO ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍການເປີດເຜີຍສາມ endpoints ດ້ວຍ {productname}, ແລະ ໃຊ້ Keycloak 21.0.1 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າເປັນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Start by installing the Keycloak IdP, then setting up the {productname} "
"Server.  Then you can add the endpoints as Keycloak clients, and create "
"users."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak IdP, ຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ endpoints ເປັນ Keycloak clients, ແລະ ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This example is provided for illustrative purposes only.  {suse} does not "
"recommend or support third-party identity service providers, and is not "
"affiliated with Keycloak.  For Keycloak support, see "
"https://www.keycloak.org/[www.keycloak.org]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can install Keycloak directly on your machine, or run it in a "
"container.  In this example, we run Keycloak in a Podman container.  For "
"more information about installing Keycloak, see the Keycloak documentation "
"at "
"https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started[https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the Identity Service Provider"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Install Keycloak in a Podman container, according to the Keycloak "
"documentation."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ Podman, ຕາມເອກະສານແນະນຳຂອງ Keycloak."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Run the container using the ``-td`` argument to ensure the process remains "
"running:"
msgstr "ຣັນຄອນເທນເນີໂດຍໃຊ້ argument ``-td`` ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າໂປຣເຊສຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_USER=admin -e "
"KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:21.0.1\n"
msgstr "podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_USER=admin -e KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:21.0.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Sign in the Keycloak {webui} as the ``admin`` user, and create an "
"authentication realm using these details:"
msgstr "ລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ Keycloak {webui} ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``admin``, ແລະ ສ້າງ authentication realm ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:11
msgid "In the ``Name`` field, enter a name for the realm."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Name``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ສຳລັບ realm."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:12
msgid "For example, ``SUMA``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``SUMA``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the ``Endpoints`` field, click the ``SAML 2.0 Identity Provider "
"Metadata`` link."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Endpoints``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ລິ້ງ ``SAML 2.0 Identity Provider Metadata``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This will lead you to a page where you will see the endpoints and "
"certificate to copy into the {productname} configuration file."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະນຳທ່ານໄປຫາໜ້າທີ່ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ endpoints ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ເພື່ອຄັດລອກລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When you have installed Keycloak and created the realm, you can prepare the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ແລະ ສ້າງ realm ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກະກຽມ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file and edit these parameters."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Replace ``<FQDN_SUMA>`` with the fully qualified domain name of your "
"{productname} installation:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``<FQDN_SUMA>`` ດ້ວຍ fully qualified domain name ຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the configuration file, replace ``<FQDN_IDP>`` with the fully qualified "
"domain name of your Keycloak server."
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ ``<FQDN_IDP>`` ດ້ວຍ fully qualified domain name ຂອງເຊີເວີ Keycloak ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:21
msgid "Replace ``<REALM>`` with your authentication realm, for example ``SUMA``:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``<REALM>`` ດ້ວຍ authentication realm ຂອງທ່ານ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``SUMA``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:23
msgid "In the IdP metadata, locate the public x509 certificate."
msgstr "ໃນ IdP metadata, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາ public x509 certificate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:24
msgid ""
"It uses this format: "
"**+http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml/descriptor+**.  In "
"the configuration file, specify the public x509 certificate of the IdP:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- "
"<CERTIFICATE>  -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- <CERTIFICATE>  -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"

#. +
#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Here is an example of [path]``rhn.conf`` on {productname} after enabling "
"SSO:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ [path]``rhn.conf`` ໃນ {productname} ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ SSO:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:27
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.sso = true\n"
msgstr "java.sso = true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# This is the configuration file for Single Sign-On (SSO) via SAMLv2 "
"protocol\n"
"# To enable SSO, set java.sso = true in /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# Mandatory changes: search this file for:\n"
"# - YOUR-PRODUCT\n"
"# - YOUR-IDP-ENTITY\n"
"#\n"
"# See product documentation and the comments inline in this file for more\n"
"# information about every parameter.\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"# If 'strict' is True, then the Java Toolkit will reject unsigned\n"
"# or unencrypted messages if it expects them signed or encrypted\n"
"# Also will reject the messages if not strictly follow the SAML\n"
"#\n"
"# WARNING: In production, this parameter setting parameter MUST be set as "
"\"true\".\n"
"# Otherwise your environment is not secure and will be exposed to attacks.\n"
"# Enable debug mode (to print errors)\n"
"# Identifier of the SP entity (must be a URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
msgstr ""
"# ນີ້ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າສຳລັບ Single Sign-On (SSO) ຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ SAMLv2\n"
"# ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ SSO, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ java.sso = true ໃນ /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ: ຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສຳລັບ:\n"
"# - YOUR-PRODUCT\n"
"# - YOUR-IDP-ENTITY\n"
"#\n"
"# ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄຳເຫັນພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ\n"
"# ກ່ຽວກັບແຕ່ລະພາຣາມິເຕີ.\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"# ຖ້າ 'strict' ເປັນ True, Java Toolkit ຈະປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັນ\n"
"# ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ຖ້າມັນຄາດຫວັງໃຫ້ມີການເຊັນ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ\n"
"# ແລະ ຈະປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຄວາມຖ້າບໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມ SAML ຢ່າງເຄັ່ງຄັດ\n"
"#\n"
"# ຄຳເຕືອນ: ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ \"true\".\n"
"# ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ປອດໄພ ແລະ ສ່ຽງຕໍ່ການຖືກໂຈມຕີ.\n"
"# ເປີດໂໝດ debug (ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ)\n"
"# ຕົວລະບຸຂອງ SP entity (ຕ້ອງເປັນ URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Specifies info about where and how the <AuthnResponse> message MUST be\n"
"# returned to the requester, in this case our SP.\n"
"# URL Location where the <Response> from the IdP will be returned\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບ່ອນໃດ ແລະ ວິທີການທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ <AuthnResponse> ຕ້ອງຖືກ\n"
"# ສົ່ງກັບຄືນໄປຫາຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ SP ຂອງພວກເຮົາ.\n"
"# ຕຳແໜ່ງ URL ບ່ອນທີ່ <Response> ຈາກ IdP ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາ\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Specifies info about where and how the <Logout Response> message MUST be\n"
"# returned to the requester, in this case our SP.\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບ່ອນໃດ ແລະ ວິທີການທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ <Logout Response> ຕ້ອງຖືກ\n"
"# ສົ່ງກັບຄືນໄປຫາຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ SP ຂອງພວກເຮົາ.\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Identifier of the IdP entity (must be a URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຕົວລະບຸຂອງ IdP entity (ຕ້ອງເປັນ URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# SSO endpoint info of the IdP. (Authentication Request protocol)\n"
"# URL Target of the IdP where the SP will send the Authentication Request "
"Message\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຂໍ້ມູນ SSO endpoint ຂອງ IdP. (ໂປຣໂຕຄໍການຮ້ອງຂໍຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ)\n"
"# URL ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງ IdP ບ່ອນທີ່ SP ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຮ້ອງຂໍການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄປໃຫ້\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# SLO endpoint info of the IdP.\n"
"# URL Location of the IdP where the SP will send the SLO Request\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຂໍ້ມູນ SLO endpoint ຂອງ IdP.\n"
"# ຕຳແໜ່ງ URL ຂອງ IdP ບ່ອນທີ່ SP ຈະສົ່ງ SLO Request ໄປໃຫ້\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
