#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:2
msgid "Channels are a method of grouping software packages."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ແມ່ນວິທີການໃນການຈັດກຸ່ມແພັກເກດຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, channels are grouped into base and child channels, with "
"base channels grouped by operating system type, version, and architecture, "
"and child channels being compatible with their related base channel.  When a "
"client has been assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that "
"system to install the related child channels.  Organizing channels in this "
"way ensures that only compatible packages are installed on each system."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base) ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child), ໂດຍຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມປະເພດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເວີຊັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຈະຕ້ອງເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ເມື່ອໄຄລແອນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ລະບົບນັ້ນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຈັດລະບຽບຊ່ອງທາງໃນລັກສະນະນີ້ຊ່ວຍຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະມີສະເພາະແພັກເກດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Software channels use repositories to provide packages.  The channels mirror "
"the repositories in {productname}, and the package names and other data are "
"stored in the {productname} database.  You can have any number of "
"repositories associated with a channel.  The software from those "
"repositories can then be installed on clients by subscribing the client to "
"the appropriate channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (repositories) ເພື່ອສະໜອງແພັກເກດ. ຊ່ອງທາງຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ mirror ຂອງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ຊື່ແພັກເກດລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}. ທ່ານສາມາດມີຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຈາກນັ້ນຊອບແວຈາກຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນສາມາດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນໄຄລແອນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຫ້ໄຄລແອນນັ້ນສະໝັກ (subscribe) ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Clients can only be assigned to one base channel.  The client can then "
"install or update packages from the repositories associated with that base "
"channel and any of its child channels."
msgstr "ໄຄລແອນສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນໄຄລແອນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກດຈາກຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກນັ້ນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍໃດໆຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} provides a number of vendor channels, which provide you "
"everything you need to run {productname}.  {productname} Administrators and "
"Channel Administrators have channel management authority, which gives them "
"the ability to create and manage their own custom channels.  If you want to "
"use your own packages in your environment, you can create custom channels.  "
"Custom channels can be used as a base channel, or you can associate them "
"with a vendor base channel."
msgstr "{productname} ມີຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ ເຊິ່ງສະໜອງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພື່ອຣັນ {productname}. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງມີອຳນາດໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (custom channels) ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານເອງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໄດ້, ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງພວກມັນກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more on creating custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Administration"
msgstr "ການດູແລຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Administration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, any user can subscribe channels to a system.  You can implement "
"restrictions on the channel using the {webui}."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນສາມາດສະໝັກຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restricting Subscriber Access to a Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງການສະໝັກຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List], and "
"select the channel to edit."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Channel List], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Locate the [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` section and check "
"[guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to "
"this channel``.  Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ [guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to this channel``. ຄລິກ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Subscribers`` tab and select or deselect users as "
"required."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Subscribers`` ແລະ ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete Channels"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ (Delete Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:15
msgid "You can delete vendor software channels from the command prompt."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ຈາກ command prompt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For information about deleting custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Vendor Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, list the "
"available vendor channels, and make a note of the channel you want to "
"delete:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແລະ ຈົດຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync list channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync list channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:20
msgid "Delete the channel:"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Related topics"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting channels manually, see "
"xref:common-workflows:workflow-removing-channel.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common examples of how you can use content "
"lifecycle management.  Use these examples to build your own personalized "
"implementation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີບາງຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປກ່ຽວກັບວິທີທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ. ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຕົວເຈົ້າເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a Project for a Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂຄງການສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:4
msgid "An example project for a monthly patch cycle consists of:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄງການສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນປະກອບມີ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:5
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a `By Date` filter"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຕົວຕອງ `ຕາມວັນທີ`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:6
msgid "Adding the filter to the project"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:7
msgid "Applying the filter to a new project build"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບການສ້າງ (Build) ໂຄງການໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:8
msgid "Excluding a patch from the project"
msgstr "ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດອອກຈາກໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:9
msgid "Including a patch in the project"
msgstr "ການລວມເອົາແພັດເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The ``By Date`` filter excludes all patches released after a specified "
"date.  This filter is useful for your content lifecycle projects that follow "
"a monthly patch cycle."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ ``ຕາມວັນທີ`` ຈະຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກໆແພັດທີ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາຫຼັງຈາກວັນທີທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຕົວຕອງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຂອງເຈົ້າທີ່ດຳເນີນຕາມຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the ``By Date`` Filter"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:13
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:38
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:14
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:90
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for your filter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:15
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude patches by date``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude patches by date``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Issue "
"date)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Issue date)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, [guimenu]``later or equal`` is "
"autoselected."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``later or equal`` ຈະຖືກເລືອກໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:18
msgid "Select the date and time."
msgstr "ເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:19
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:25
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:45
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:62
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:149
msgid "Click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding the Filter to the Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a Filter to a Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] "
"and select a project from the list."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link to see all available filters"
msgstr "ຄລິກລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຕອງທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:24
msgid "Select the new [guimenu]``Exclude patches by date`` filter."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ [guimenu]``Exclude patches by date``."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applying the Filter to a new Project Build"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The new filter is added to your filter list, but it still needs to be "
"applied to the project.  To apply the filter you need to build the first "
"environment."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ຕົວຕອງຂອງເຈົ້າແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂຄງການ. ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ (Build) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using the Filter"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:29
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to build the first environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:30
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add a message."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:31
msgid "You can use messages to help track the build history."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕິດຕາມປະຫວັດການສ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Check that the filter has worked correctly by using the new channels on a "
"test server."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ໃໝ່ໃນເຊີບເວີທົດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Promote] to move the content to the next environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Promote] ເພື່ອຍ້າຍເນື້ອຫາໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The build takes longer if you have a large number of filters, or they are "
"very complex."
msgstr "ການສ້າງຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນຖ້າເຈົ້າມີຕົວຕອງຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຕົວຕອງນັ້ນມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Excluding a Patch from the Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Tests may help you discover issues.  When an issue is found, exclude the "
"problem patch released before the `by date` filter."
msgstr "ການທົດສອບອາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າພົບຫາບັນຫາ. ເມື່ອພົບບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດທີ່ມີບັນຫາເຊິ່ງຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາກ່ອນຕົວຕອງ `ຕາມວັນທີ`."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding a Patch"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:39
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, enter a name for the filter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:40
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude openjdk patch``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude openjdk patch``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:41
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Advisory "
"Name)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Advisory Name)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:42
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:57
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [guimenu]``equals``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``equals``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:43
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Advisory Name`` field, type a name for the advisory."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Advisory Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງ Advisory."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:44
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``SUSE-15-2019-1807``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``SUSE-15-2019-1807``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:46
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:99
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:137
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:162
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:83
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:101
msgid "Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link, select [guimenu]``Exclude openjdk "
"patch``, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Exclude openjdk patch``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When you rebuild the project with the btn:[Build] button, the new filter is "
"used together with the [guimenu]``by date`` filter we added before."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ btn:[Build], ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``ຕາມວັນທີ`` ທີ່ເຮົາໄດ້ເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Including a Patch in the Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In this example, you have received a security alert.  An important security "
"patch was released several days after the first of the month you are "
"currently working on.  The name of the new patch is ``SUSE-15-2019-2071``.  "
"You need to include this new patch into your environment."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄວາມປອດໄພ. ແພັດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ສຳຄັນຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາສອງສາມມື້ຫຼັງຈາກຕົ້ນເດືອນທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ຊື່ຂອງແພັດໃໝ່ແມ່ນ ``SUSE-15-2019-2071``. ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລວມເອົາແພັດໃໝ່ນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Allow`` filters rule overrides the exclude function of the "
"[guimenu]``Deny`` filter rule.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກົດເກນຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Allow`` ຈະທັບຊ້ອນ (Override) ຟັງຊັນການຍົກເວັ້ນຂອງກົດເກນຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Deny``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Including a Patch in a Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:54
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for the filter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:55
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Include kernel security fix``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Include kernel security fix``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:58
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Advisory Name`` field, type "
"[guimenu]``SUSE-15-2019-2071``, and check [guimenu]``Allow``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Advisory Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [guimenu]``SUSE-15-2019-2071``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Allow``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:59
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:98
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to store the filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project from "
"the list."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and select [guimenu]``Include kernel "
"security patch``."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ແລະ ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Include kernel security patch``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:63
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:114
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to rebuild the environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an Existing Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When a monthly patch cycle is complete, you can update the patch cycle for "
"the next month."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການແພັດສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating a Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:67
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``by date`` field, change the date of the filter to the next "
"month."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``by date``, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນວັນທີຂອງຕົວຕອງເປັນເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:68
msgid "Alternatively, create a new filter and change the assignment to the project."
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ ສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ່ຽນການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Check if the exclude filter for ``SUSE-15-2019-1807`` can be detached from "
"the project."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງຍົກເວັ້ນສຳລັບ ``SUSE-15-2019-1807`` ສາມາດຖອນອອກຈາກໂຄງການໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:70
msgid "There may be a new patch available to fix this issue."
msgstr "ອາດຈະມີແພັດໃໝ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:71
msgid "Detach the ``allow`` filter you added previously."
msgstr "ຖອນຕົວຕອງ ``allow`` ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:72
msgid "The patch is included by default."
msgstr "ແພັດຈະຖືກລວມເອົາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Rebuild the project to create a new environment with patches for the next "
"month."
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ທີ່ມີແພັດສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhance a Project with Live Patching"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:75
msgid ""
"This section covers setting up filters to create environments for live "
"patching."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕອງເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການແພັດແບບສົດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:76
msgid ""
"When you are preparing to use live patching, there are some important "
"considerations"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:77
msgid "Only ever use one kernel version on your systems."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄີເນິນ (Kernel) ພຽງເວີຊັນດຽວໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າສະເໝີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:78
msgid "The live patching packages are installed with a specific kernel."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດການແພັດແບບສົດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງກັບເຄີເນິນສະເພາະຕົວໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:79
msgid "Live patching updates are shipped as one patch."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດການແພັດແບບສົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບແພັດດຽວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Each kernel patch that begins a new series of live patching kernels displays "
"the ``required reboot`` flag."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແພັດເຄີເນິນທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຊີຣີໃໝ່ຂອງເຄີເນິນການແພັດແບບສົດຈະສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``required reboot`` (ຕ້ອງຣີບູດ)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:81
msgid ""
"These kernel patches come with live patching tools.  When you have installed "
"them, you need to reboot the system at least once before the next year."
msgstr "ແພັດເຄີເນິນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມາພ້ອມກັບເຄື່ອງມືການແພັດແບບສົດ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຣີບູດລະບົບຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງກ່ອນປີໜ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:82
msgid "Only install live patch updates that match the installed kernel version."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະການອັບເດດແພັດແບບສົດທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:83
msgid "Live patches are provided as stand-alone patches."
msgstr "ແພັດແບບສົດຈະຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ (Stand-alone)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:84
msgid ""
"You must exclude all regular kernel patches with higher kernel version than "
"the currently installed one."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນສູງກວ່າເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude Packages with a Higher Kernel Version"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In this example you update your systems with the ``SUSE-15-2019-1244`` "
"patch.  This patch contains ``kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64``."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ເຈົ້າອັບເດດລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າດ້ວຍແພັດ ``SUSE-15-2019-1244``. ແພັດນີ້ປະກອບມີ ``kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:87
msgid ""
"You need to exclude all patches which contain a higher version of "
"[package]``kernel-default`` and [package]``kernel-default-base``."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກໆແພັດທີ່ປະກອບມີເວີຊັນທີ່ສູງກວ່າຂອງ [package]``kernel-default`` ແລະ [package]``kernel-default-base``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding Packages with a Higher Kernel Version"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:89
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:76
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:94
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:91
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:92
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Contains "
"Package)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Contains Package)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:93
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [guimenu]``version greater than``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``version greater than``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:94
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Package Name`` field, type [systemitem]``kernel-default``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Package Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``kernel-default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:95
msgid "Leave the the [guimenu]``Epoch`` field empty."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:96
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Version`` field, type [systemitem]``4.12.14``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Version``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``4.12.14``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:97
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Release`` field, type [systemitem]``150.17.1``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Release``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``150.17.1``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:100
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:23
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:84
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:102
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Select [guimenu]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:102
msgid ""
"You need to repeat this procedure for the [package]``kernel-default-base`` "
"package."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບແພັກເກດ [package]``kernel-default-base``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:103
msgid ""
"When you click btn:[Build], a new environment is created.  The new "
"environment contains all the kernel patches up to the version you installed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຄລິກ btn:[Build], ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະປະກອບມີທຸກໆແພັດເຄີເນິນຈົນເຖິງເວີຊັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:104
msgid ""
"All kernel patches with higher kernel versions are removed.  Live patching "
"kernels remain available as long as they are not the first in a series."
msgstr "ແພັດເຄີເນິນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກຖອນອອກ. ເຄີເນິນການແພັດແບບສົດຈະຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວທຳອິດໃນຊີຣີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:105
msgid ""
"This procedure can be automated using a filter template.  For more "
"information on how to apply a live patching filter template, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ (Filter template). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງການແພັດແບບສົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to a New Kernel Version for Live Patching"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Live Patching for a specific kernel version is only available for one year.  "
"After one year you must update the kernel on your systems.  Execute these "
"environment changes:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Switch to a New Kernel Version"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:109
msgid "Decide which kernel version to upgrade to."
msgstr "ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:110
msgid "For example: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:111
msgid "Create a new kernel version Filter."
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວຕອງເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:112
msgid "Detach all previous Live Patching filters associated with the old kernel."
msgstr "ຖອນຕົວຕອງການແພັດແບບສົດກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຄີເນິນເກົ່າອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:113
msgid "Attach the new kernel version filter."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຕົວຕອງເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Once the build is complete, you must immediately re-attach the two filters "
"which:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອການສ້າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຕົວຕອງສອງອັນຄືນໃໝ່ທັນທີ ເຊິ່ງຈະ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:116
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:72
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:90
msgid "Deny patches that contain ``reboot_suggested`` keyword"
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດ (Deny) ແພັດທີ່ມີຄຳສຳຄັນ ``reboot_suggested``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:117
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:73
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Deny patches that contain a package which provides the name "
"``installhint(reboot-needed)``"
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດແພັດທີ່ມີແພັກເກດເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຊື່ ``installhint(reboot-needed)``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:118
msgid ""
"The new environment contains all kernel patches up to the new kernel version "
"you selected.  Systems using these channels have the kernel update available "
"for installation.  You need to reboot systems after they have performed the "
"upgrade.  The new kernel remains valid for one year.  All packages installed "
"during the year match the current live patching kernel filter."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream Filters"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:120
msgid ""
"If you are using {rhel}{nbsp}8 clients or later, you cannot perform package "
"operations such as installing or upgrading directly from modular "
"repositories like the {rhel} AppStream repository.  You can use the "
"AppStream filter to transform modular repositories into regular "
"repositories.  It does this by keeping the packages in the repository and "
"stripping away the module metadata.  The resulting repository can be used in "
"{productname} in the same way as a regular repository."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:121
msgid ""
"The AppStream filter selects a single module stream to be included in the "
"target repository.  You can add multiple filters to select multiple module "
"streams."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຈະເລືອກສາຍທານໂມດູລາ (Module stream) ດຽວເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງໄດ້ຫຼາຍອັນເພື່ອເລືອກສາຍທານໂມດູລາຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:122
msgid ""
"If you do not use an AppStream filter in your CLM project, the module "
"metadata in the modular sources remains intact, and the target repositories "
"contain the same module metadata.  As long as at least one AppStream filter "
"is enabled in the CLM project, all target repositories are transformed into "
"regular repositories."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໃນໂຄງການ CLM ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາຂອງໂມດູລາໃນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໂມດູລາຈະຍັງຄົງຄືເກົ່າ, ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາຂອງໂມດູລາແບບດຽວກັນ. ຕາບໃດທີ່ມີການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນໃນໂຄງການ CLM, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:123
msgid ""
"In some cases, you might wish to build regular repositories without having "
"to include packages from any module.  To do so, add an AppStream filter "
"using the matcher [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``.  This will "
"disable all the modules in the target repository.  This is especially useful "
"for {rhel}{nbsp}9 clients, where the default versions of most modules are "
"already included in the AppStream repository as regular packages."
msgstr "ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລວມເອົາແພັກເກດຈາກໂມດູລາໃດໆ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ (Matcher) [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດການນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູລາທັງໝົດໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel}{nbsp}9, ເຊິ່ງເວີຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູລາສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບ AppStream ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດປົກກະຕິຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:124
msgid ""
"To use the AppStream filter, you need a CLM project with a modular "
"repository such as ``{rhel} AppStreams``.  Ensure that you included the "
"module you need as a source before you begin."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໂຄງການ CLM ທີ່ມີຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບໂມດູລາ ເຊັ່ນ ``{rhel} AppStreams``. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ລວມເອົາໂມດູລາທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using AppStream Filters"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:126
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:141
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:155
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to your {rhel}{nbsp}8 or 9 CLM "
"project."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໂຄງການ CLM {rhel}{nbsp}8 ຫຼື 9 ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:127
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:142
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:156
msgid "Ensure that you have included the AppStream channels for your project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ລວມເອົາຊ່ອງທາງ AppStream ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:128
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:143
msgid "Click btn:``Create Filter`` and use these parameters:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:129
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:144
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:158
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for the new filter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:130
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:145
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:159
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [parameter]``Module "
"(Stream)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``Module (Stream)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:131
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:146
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [parameter]``equals``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``equals``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:132
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Module Name`` field, type a module name."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Module Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໂມດູລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:133
msgid "For example, [parameter]``postgresql``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``postgresql``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:134
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Stream`` field, type the name of the desired stream."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Stream``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງສາຍທານ (Stream) ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:135
msgid ""
"For example, [parameter]``10``.  If you leave this field blank, the default "
"stream for the module is selected."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``10``. ຖ້າເຈົ້າປະຫ້ອງນີ້ໄວ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງ, ສາຍທານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂມດູລາຈະຖືກເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:136
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:161
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the new filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:138
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:163
msgid ""
"Click btn:``Attach/Detach Filters``, select your new AppStream filter, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:139
msgid ""
"You can use the browse function in the ``Create/Edit Filter`` form to select "
"a module from a list of available module streams for a modular channel."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການຄົ້ນຫາ (Browse) ໃນແບບຟອມ ``Create/Edit Filter`` ເພື່ອເລືອກໂມດູລາຈາກລາຍຊື່ສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Browsing Available Module Streams"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:147
msgid "Click ``Browse available modules`` to see all modular channels."
msgstr "ຄລິກ ``Browse available modules`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:148
msgid "Select a channel to browse the modules and streams:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາໂມດູລາ ແລະ ສາຍທານ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:149
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Module Name`` field, start typing a module name to search, "
"or select from the list."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Module Name``, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ໂມດູລາເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:150
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Stream`` field, start typing a stream name to search, or "
"select from the list."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Stream``, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ສາຍທານເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:151
msgid ""
"Channel selection is only for browsing modules.  The selected channel is not "
"be saved with the filter, and does not affect the CLM process in any way."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ນເພື່ອການຄົ້ນຫາໂມດູລາເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ກັບຕົວຕອງ, ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບໃດໆຕໍ່ຂະບວນການ CLM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:152
msgid ""
"You can create additional AppStream filters for any other module stream to "
"be included in the target repository.  Any module streams that the selected "
"stream depends on is automatically included."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບສາຍທານໂມດູລາອື່ນໆເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງ. ສາຍທານໂມດູລາໃດໆທີ່ສາຍທານທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນຕ້ອງການ (Dependency) ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:153
msgid ""
"Be careful not to specify conflicting, incompatible, or missing module "
"streams.  For example, selecting two streams from the same module is "
"invalid."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງບໍ່ໃຫ້ກຳນົດສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ, ເຂົ້າກັນບໍ່ໄດ້ ຫຼື ຫາຍໄປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເລືອກສອງສາຍທານຈາກໂມດູລາດຽວກັນແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:154
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling Modularity"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:157
msgid "Click btn:[Create Filter] and use these parameters:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter] ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄ່າກຳນົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:160
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [parameter]``none (disable "
"modularity)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:164
msgid ""
"This will effectively remove the module metadata from the target repository, "
"excluding any package that belongs to a module."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖອນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາຂອງໂມດູລາອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິຜົນ, ໂດຍຈະຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກໆແພັກເກດທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບໂມດູລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:165
msgid ""
"When you build your CLM project using the btn:[Build] button in the {webui}, "
"the target repository is a regular repository without any modules, that "
"contains packages from the selected module streams."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໂຄງການ CLM ຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build] ໃນ {webui}, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງຈະເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິທີ່ບໍ່ມີໂມດູລາໃດໆ, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີແພັກເກດຈາກສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:166
msgid ""
"Disabling modularity altogether in {rhel}{nbsp}8 projects might result in a "
"faulty environment as some modules are essential for healthy operation in "
"{rhel}{nbsp}8."
msgstr "ການປິດການນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູລາທັງໝົດໃນໂຄງການ {rhel}{nbsp}8 ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ເນື່ອງຈາກບາງໂມດູລາແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ປົກກະຕິໃນ {rhel}{nbsp}8."

#.  For 4.3 only:
#.  This feature is mandatory to make RHEL/CentOS 8 modular repositories work
#.  in the SUMA UI. Otherwise, even though modular repositories can be synced
#.  and assigned to clients, they cannot be used for package operations
#.  (install, update, etc.) from SUMA UI (An info message is shown in the UI if
#.  that's the case). In that case, the package operations can only be done
#.  from the client's CLI manually.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to customize and test packages "
"before updating production clients.  This is especially useful if you need "
"to apply updates during a limited maintenance window."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ທົດສອບແພັກເກດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍໃນລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (Production). ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເປັນພິເສດຖ້າເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງໄລຍະເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (Maintenance window) ທີ່ຈຳກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to select software channels as "
"sources, adjust them as required for your environment, and thoroughly test "
"them before installing onto your production clients."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແລະ ທົດສອບພວກມັນຢ່າງລະອຽດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ລູກຂ່າຍໃນລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid ""
"While you cannot directly modify vendor channels, you can clone them and "
"then modify the clones by adding or removing packages and custom patches.  "
"You can assign these cloned channels to test clients to ensure they work as "
"expected."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (Vendor channels) ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດສຳເນົາ (Clone) ພວກມັນ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ຽນແປງສຳເນົານັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຖອນແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທົດສອບເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"By default, cloned vendor channels match the original vendor channel and "
"automatically select the dependencies.  You can disable the automatic "
"selection for cloned channels by adding the following option in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາຈະກົງກັບຊ່ອງທາງເດີມ ແລະ ຈະເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (Dependencies) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດການເລືອກອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"
msgstr "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Then, when all tests pass, you can promote the cloned channels to production "
"servers."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອການທົດສອບທັງໝົດຜ່ານແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລື່ອນລະດັບ (Promote) ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົານັ້ນໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີໃນລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This is achieved through a series of environments that your software "
"channels can move through on their lifecycle.  Most environment lifecycles "
"include at least test and production environments, but you can have as many "
"environments as you require."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳເລັດໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານຊຸດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງເຈົ້າສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຜ່ານວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງພວກມັນ. ວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະປະກອບມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທົດສອບ ແລະ ລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໄດ້ຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This section covers the basic content lifecycle procedures, and the filters "
"available.  For more specific examples, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາຂັ້ນຕອນພື້ນຖານຂອງວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To set up a content lifecycle, you need to begin with a project.  The "
"project defines the software channel sources, the filters used to find "
"packages, and the build environments."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໂຄງການ. ໂຄງການຈະກຳນົດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາແພັກເກດ, ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນການສ້າງ (Build environments)."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and click btn:[Create Project]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Project]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, enter a label for your project."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນປ້າຍຊື່ (Label) ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Label`` field only accepts lowercase letters, numbers, "
"periods, hyphens, and underscores."
msgstr "ຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Label`` ຮັບຮອງເອົາສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນພາສາອັງກິດໂຕພິມນ້ອຍ, ຕົວເລກ, ຈຸດ (.), ເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົບ (-), ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ (_) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, enter a descriptive name for your project."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Create] button to create your project and return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ ກັບຄືນໄປຍັງໜ້າໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Sources`` dialog, select the source type, and select a "
"base channel for your project."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Sources``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (Base channel) ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The available child channels for the selected base channel are displayed, "
"including information on whether the channel is mandatory or recommended."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (Child channels) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກສະແດງຂຶ້ນ, ລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບັງຄັບ ຫຼື ແນະນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Check the child channels you require, and click btn:[Save] to return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອກັບຄືນໄປຍັງໜ້າໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid "The software channels you selected should now be showing."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກຄວນຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນໃນເວລານີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filters`` dialog, select the filters you want to attach to "
"the project."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Filters``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວຕອງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງເຂົ້າກັບໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid "To create a new filter, click btn:[Create new Filter]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create new Filter]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Add Environment]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add Environment]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` dialog, give the first environment "
"a name, a label, and a description, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຊື່, ປ້າຍຊື່, ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍໃຫ້ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Continue creating environments until you have all the environments for your "
"lifecycle completed."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະມີທຸກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງເຈົ້າຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can select the order of the environments in the lifecycle by selecting "
"an environment in the [guimenu]``Insert before`` field when you create it."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກລຳດັບຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນວົງຈອນຊີວິດໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Insert before`` ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງມັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter Types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:32
msgid ""
"{productname} allows you to create various types of filters to control the "
"content used for building the project.  Filters allow you to select which "
"packages are included or excluded from the build.  For example, you could "
"exclude all kernel packages, or include only specific releases of some "
"packages."
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງຕົວຕອງປະເພດຕ່າງໆເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມເນື້ອຫາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງໂຄງການ. ຕົວຕອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກວ່າແພັກເກດໃດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກການສ້າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກແພັກເກດເຄີເນິນ, ຫຼື ລວມເອົາສະເພາະການປ່ອຍ (Releases) ທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງບາງແພັກເກດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:33
msgid "The supported filters are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:34
msgid "package filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັກເກດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:35
msgid "by name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:36
msgid "by name, epoch, version, release, and architecture"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່, epoch, ເວີຊັນ, release, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (Architecture)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:37
msgid "by provided name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:38
msgid "patch filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:39
msgid "by advisory name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່ Advisory"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:40
msgid "by advisory type"
msgstr "ຕາມປະເພດ Advisory"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:41
msgid "by synopsis"
msgstr "ຕາມບົດສະຫຼຸບ (Synopsis)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:42
msgid "by keyword"
msgstr "ຕາມຄຳສຳຄັນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:43
msgid "by date"
msgstr "ຕາມວັນທີ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:44
msgid "by affected package"
msgstr "ຕາມແພັກເກດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:45
msgid "module"
msgstr "ໂມດູລາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:46
msgid "by stream"
msgstr "ຕາມສາຍທານ (Stream)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:47
msgid "Package dependencies are not resolved during content filtering."
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ແພັກເກດຕ້ອງການ (Dependencies) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕອງເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:48
msgid ""
"There are multiple matchers you can use with the filter.  Which ones are "
"available depends on the filter type you choose."
msgstr "ມີຕົວຈັບຄູ່ (Matchers) ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຕົວຕອງ. ຕົວໃດທີ່ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ນັ້ນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຕົວຕອງທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:49
msgid "The available matchers are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:50
msgid "contains"
msgstr "ປະກອບມີ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:51
msgid "matches (must take the form of a regular expression)"
msgstr "ກົງກັບ (ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Regular expression)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:52
msgid "equals"
msgstr "ເທົ່າກັບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:53
msgid "greater"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍກວ່າ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:54
msgid "greater or equal"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:55
msgid "lower or equal"
msgstr "ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:56
msgid "lower"
msgstr "ນ້ອຍກວ່າ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:57
msgid "later or equal"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter ``rule`` Parameter"
msgstr "ຄ່າກຳນົດ ``rule`` ຂອງຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Each filter has a ``rule`` parameter that can be set to either ``Allow`` or "
"``Deny``.  The filters are processed like this:"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງຈະມີຄ່າກຳນົດ ``rule`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ ``Allow`` (ອະນຸຍາດ) ຫຼື ``Deny`` (ປະຕິເສດ). ຕົວຕອງຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies a ``Deny`` filter, it is excluded from the "
"result."
msgstr "ຖ້າແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດໃດໜຶ່ງກົງກັບຕົວຕອງ ``Deny``, ມັນຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກຜົນລັບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies an ``Allow`` filter, it is included in the "
"result (even if it was excluded by a ``Deny`` filter). ``Allow`` filters for "
"packages only operate on package filters and ``Allow`` filters for patches "
"only operate on patch filters. This means with a package filter you cannot "
"add packages back in that were filtered out through patch filters or vice "
"versa for patches that where filtered out through package filters."
msgstr "ຖ້າແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດໃດໜຶ່ງກົງກັບຕົວຕອງ ``Allow``, ມັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຜົນລັບ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນໂດຍຕົວຕອງ ``Deny`` ກໍຕາມ). ຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສຳລັບແພັກເກດຈະເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະກັບຕົວຕອງແພັກເກດເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສຳລັບແພັດຈະເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະກັບຕົວຕອງແພັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງແພັກເກດເພື່ອເອົາແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຄັດອອກໂດຍຕົວຕອງແພັດກັບຄືນມາໄດ້, ຫຼື ໃນທາງກັບກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:62
msgid ""
"This behavior is useful when you want to exclude large number of packages or "
"patches using a general ``Deny`` filter and \"cherry-pick\" specific "
"packages or patches with specific ``Allow`` filters."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ ``Deny`` ແບບທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ \"ເລືອກເອົາສະເພາະ\" (Cherry-pick) ແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດທີ່ແນ່ນອນດ້ວຍຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສະເພາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Content filters are global in your organization and can be shared between "
"projects."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງເນື້ອຫາແມ່ນມີຜົນບັງຄັບໃຊ້ທົ່ວທັງອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງໂຄງການຕ່າງໆໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:64
msgid ""
"If your project already contains built sources, when you add an environment "
"it is automatically populated with the existing content.  Content is drawn "
"from the previous environment of the cycle if it had one.  If there is no "
"previous environment, it is left empty until the project sources are built "
"again."
msgstr "ຖ້າໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ມັນຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນວົງຈອນຖ້າມີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ມັນຈະຖືກປະໄວ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງຈົນກວ່າແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໂຄງການຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter Templates"
msgstr "ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To help with creating filters for some common scenarios, {productname} "
"offers filter templates.  When applied, these templates help creating a set "
"of filters in advance, tailored for a specific use case."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການສ້າງຕົວຕອງສຳລັບບາງສະຖານະການທົ່ວໄປ, {productname} ໄດ້ສະໜອງແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງໃຫ້. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້, ແມ່ແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍສ້າງຊຸດຕົວຕອງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເຊິ່ງຖືກປັບແຕ່ງມາໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບການນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕົວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:67
msgid "This section describes available templates and their usages."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບແມ່ແບບທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ແລະ ການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a SUSE product"
msgstr "ການແພັດສົດ (Live patching) ອີງຕາມຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:69
msgid ""
"In a project that contains live patching, regular future kernel packages "
"must be excluded so that only live patch packages are offered as updates to "
"clients. On the other hand, already installed regular kernel packages must "
"still be included to keep system integrity."
msgstr "ໃນໂຄງການທີ່ປະກອບມີການແພັດແບບສົດ, ແພັກເກດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິໃນອະນາຄົດຕ້ອງຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະເພາະແພັກເກດການແພັດແບບສົດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສະເໜີໃຫ້ເປັນການອັບເດດແກ່ລູກຂ່າຍ. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ແພັກເກດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ແລ້ວຕ້ອງຍັງຄົງຖືກລວມເອົາໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:70
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:88
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates three filters required to achieve this "
"behavior:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຈະສ້າງຕົວຕອງສາມອັນທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພຶດຕິກຳດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:71
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:89
msgid ""
"Allow patches that contain ``kernel-default`` package equal to a base kernel "
"version"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດ (Allow) ແພັດທີ່ປະກອບມີແພັກເກດ ``kernel-default`` ທີ່ເທົ່າກັບເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນຫຼັກ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:74
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up a live patching project, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການການແພັດແບບສົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:75
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:93
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying the template"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:77
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template]. The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Use a template]. ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງປ້ອນຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Prefix`` field, type a name prefix. This value will be "
"prepended to the name of every individual filter created by the template. If "
"the template is being applied in the context of a project, this field will "
"be prefilled with the project label."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Prefix``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳນຳໜ້າຊື່ (Prefix). ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ຂ້າງໜ້າຊື່ຂອງແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍແມ່ແບບ. ຖ້າແມ່ແບບຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງໂຄງການ, ຫ້ອງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍປ້າຍຊື່ໂຄງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:79
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``Live patching based on "
"a SUSE product``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Live patching based on a SUSE product``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Product`` field, select the product you wish to set up "
"live patching for."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Product``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແພັດແບບສົດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:81
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field, select a kernel version from the list of "
"versions available in the selected product. The filter to deny the later "
"regular kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນຈາກລາຍຊື່ເວີຊັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເລືອກ. ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຈະປະຕິເສດແພັດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິໃນພາຍຫຼັງແມ່ນຈະອີງຕາມເວີຊັນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:82
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:100
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:119
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the filters."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:85
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:103
msgid ""
"Select the three filters that have the specified prefix, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວຕອງທັງສາມອັນທີ່ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a system"
msgstr "Live patching ຕາມລະບົບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:87
msgid ""
"When you want to set up a live patching project based on a kernel version "
"installed in a specific registered system, you can use the \"live patching "
"based on a system\" template."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການການແພັດແບບສົດໂດຍອີງຕາມເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ \"live patching based on a system\" ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:95
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:115
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template].  The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Use a template]. ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງປ້ອນຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:96
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:116
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Prefix`` field, type a name prefix.  This value will be "
"prepended to the name of every filter created by the template.  If the "
"template is being applied in the context of a project, this field will be "
"prefilled with the project label."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Prefix``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳນຳໜ້າຊື່. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ຂ້າງໜ້າຊື່ຂອງທຸກໆຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍແມ່ແບບ. ຖ້າແມ່ແບບຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງໂຄງການ, ຫ້ອງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍປ້າຍຊື່ໂຄງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:97
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``Live patching based on "
"a specific system``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Live patching based on a specific system``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:98
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``System`` field, select a system from the list, or start "
"typing a system name to narrow down the options."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``System``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລະບົບຈາກລາຍຊື່, ຫຼື ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ລະບົບເພື່ອຈຳກັດຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ແຄບລົງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:99
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field, select a kernel version from the list of "
"versions installed in the selected system.  The filter to deny the later "
"regular kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນຈາກລາຍຊື່ເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຈະປະຕິເສດແພັດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິໃນພາຍຫຼັງແມ່ນຈະອີງຕາມເວີຊັນນີ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream modules with defaults"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ AppStream ພ້ອມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:105
msgid ""
"When you want to have all the modules available in a modular repository "
"included in your project, you can automatically add them using this filter "
"template."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີທຸກໂມດູລາທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບໂມດູລາລວມຢູ່ໃນໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:106
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates an AppStream filter per module and its "
"default stream."
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຈະສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂມດູລາ ແລະ ສາຍທານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:107
msgid ""
"If this process is done from the project's page, the filters are added to "
"the project automatically. Otherwise, the created filters can be listed in "
"menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] and be added to any project as needed."
msgstr "ຖ້າຂະບວນການນີ້ເຮັດຈາກໜ້າຂອງໂຄງການ, ຕົວຕອງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສາມາດຖືກສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໃນ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການໃດໆກໍໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Each individual filter can be edited to select a different module stream, or "
"removed altogether to exclude that module from the target repositories."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງສາມາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເລືອກສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ຫຼື ສາມາດຖອນອອກທັງໝົດເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນໂມດູລານັ້ນອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:109
msgid ""
"Because not all module streams are compatible with each other, changing "
"individual streams may prevent successful resolution of modular "
"dependencies. When this happens, the filters pane in the project details "
"page will show an error describing the problem, and the build button will be "
"disabled until all the module selections are compatible."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກສາຍທານໂມດູລາຈະເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້, ການປ່ຽນແປງສາຍທານແຕ່ລະອັນອາດຈະຂັດຂວາງການແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງທີ່ໂມດູລາຕ້ອງການ (Modular dependencies). ເມື່ອສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ແຜງຕົວຕອງໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດໂຄງການຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ອະທິບາຍບັນຫາ, ແລະ ປຸ່ມສ້າງ (Build) ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານຈົນກວ່າການເລືອກໂມດູລາທັງໝົດຈະເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Since {rhel}{nbsp}9, modules do not have any defined default streams.  "
"Therefore, using this template with {rhel}{nbsp}9 sources will have no "
"effect."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ {rhel}{nbsp}9 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ໂມດູລາບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດສາຍທານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃດໆ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບນີ້ກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ {rhel}{nbsp}9 ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:111
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up AppStream repositories with content "
"lifecycle management, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream ດ້ວຍການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:113
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select your project."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:114
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filters`` section, click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and "
"then click btn:[Create New Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Filters``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ btn:[Create New Filter]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:117
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``AppStream modules with "
"defaults``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``AppStream modules with defaults``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:118
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Channel`` field, select a modular channel to get the "
"modules from. In this dropdown, only the modular channels are displayed."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາເພື່ອດຶງໂມດູລາມາຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ. ໃນລາຍຊື່ແບບເລື່ອນລົງນີ້, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສະແດງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:120
msgid ""
"Scroll to the [guimenu]``Filters`` section to see the newly attached "
"AppStream filters."
msgstr "ເລື່ອນໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Filters`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ທີ່ຫາກໍຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງເຂົ້າໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:121
msgid ""
"You can edit/remove any individual filter to tailor the project to your "
"needs."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ/ຖອນຕົວຕອງແຕ່ລະອັນອອກໄດ້ ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໂຄງການໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:123
msgid ""
"When you have created your project, defined environments, and attached "
"sources and filters, you can build the project for the first time."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໂຄງການ, ກຳນົດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງ (Build) ໂຄງການເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:124
msgid ""
"Building applies filters to the attached sources and clones them to the "
"first environment in the project."
msgstr "ການສ້າງຈະນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ ແລະ ເຮັດສຳເນົາພວກມັນໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດໃນໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:125
msgid ""
"You can use the same vendor channels as sources for multiple content "
"projects.  In this case, {productname} does not create new patch clones for "
"each cloned channel.  Instead, a single patch clone is shared between all of "
"your cloned channels.  This can cause problems if a vendor modifies a patch; "
"for example, if the patch is retracted, or the packages within the patch are "
"changed.  When you build one of the content projects, all the channels that "
"share the cloned patch are synchronized with the original by default, even "
"if the channels are in other environments of your content project, or other "
"content project channels in your organization.  You can change this behavior "
"by turning off automatic patch synchronization in your organization "
"settings.  To manually synchronize the patch later for all channels sharing "
"the patch, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], click the channel "
"you want to synchronize and navigate to the [guimenu]``Sync`` subtab.  Even "
"manual patch synchronization affects all organization channels sharing the "
"patch."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດດຽວກັນເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບຫຼາຍໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, {productname} ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງສຳເນົາແພັດໃໝ່ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາ. ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳເນົາແພັດດຽວຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາຂອງເຈົ້າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໄດ້ຖ້າຜູ້ຜະລິດມີການແກ້ໄຂແພັດ; ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າແພັດຖືກຖອນຄືນ, ຫຼື ແພັກເກດພາຍໃນແພັດຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ, ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳເນົາແພັດຮ່ວມກັນຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (Synchronized) ກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອື່ນໆຂອງໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາຂອງເຈົ້າ, ຫຼື ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາອື່ນໆໃນອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າກໍຕາມ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການປິດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ. ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນພາຍຫຼັງສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ແພັດຮ່ວມກັນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels], ຄລິກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Sync``. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກໍຍັງມີຜົນຕໍ່ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງໃນອົງກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ແພັດນັ້ນຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:127
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to build."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:128
msgid "Make sure you have the environment available before building the project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:129
msgid "Review the attached sources and filters, and click btn:[Build]."
msgstr "ກວດສອບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Build]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:130
msgid "Provide a version message to describe the changes or updates in this build."
msgstr "ລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມເວີຊັນເພື່ອອະທິບາຍການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ການອັບເດດໃນການສ້າງຄັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:131
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:138
msgid ""
"You can monitor build progress in the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` "
"section."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການສ້າງໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:132
msgid ""
"After the build is finished, the environment version is increased by one and "
"the built sources, such as software channels, can be assigned to your "
"clients."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເວີຊັນຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໜຶ່ງລະດັບ ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ຈະສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Promote Environments"
msgstr "ເລື່ອນລະດັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:134
msgid ""
"When the project has been built, the built sources can be sequentially "
"promoted to the environments."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໂຄງການຖືກສ້າງແລ້ວ, ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສາມາດຖືກເລື່ອນລະດັບໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕ່າງໆຕາມລຳດັບ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Promoting Environments"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລື່ອນລະດັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:136
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to work with."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:137
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` section, locate the environment to "
"promote to its successor, and click btn:[Promote]."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຕ້ອງການເລື່ອນລະດັບໄປຍັງລຳດັບຖັດໄປ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Promote]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign Clients to Environments"
msgstr "ກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:140
msgid ""
"When you build and promote content lifecycle projects, {productname} creates "
"a tree of software channels.  To add clients to the environment, assign the "
"base and child software channels to your client using menu:Software[Software "
"Channels] in the [guimenu]``System Details`` page for the client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງ ແລະ ເລື່ອນລະດັບໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, {productname} ຈະສ້າງໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຫຼັກ ແລະ ຍ່ອຍໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ menu:Software[Software Channels] ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Details`` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:141
msgid ""
"Newly added cloned channels are not assigned to clients automatically.  If "
"you add or promote sources you need to manually check and update your "
"channel assignments."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ເເລື່ອນລະດັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:142
msgid ""
"Automatic assignment is intended to be added to {productname} in a future "
"version."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດມີແຜນທີ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ເວີຊັນໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Staging"
msgstr "ການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ (Content Staging)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Staging is used by clients to download packages in advance, before they are "
"installed.  This allows package installation to begin as soon as it is "
"scheduled, which can reduce the amount of time required for a maintenance "
"window."
msgstr "ການພັກຂໍ້ມູນ (Staging) ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ກ່ອນທີ່ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ທັນທີຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຫຼຸດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (Maintenance window) ລົງໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Content Staging"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can manage content staging across your entire organization.  In the "
"{productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations] to see a list "
"of available organizations.  Click the name of an organization, and check "
"the [guimenu]``Enable Staging Contents`` box to allow clients in this "
"organization to stage package data."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈັດການການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາໄດ້ທົ່ວທັງອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ. ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Organizations] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ອົງກອນທີ່ມີໃຫ້. ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ອົງກອນ, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Enable Staging Contents`` ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໃນອົງກອນນີ້ສາມາດພັກຂໍ້ມູນແພັກເກດໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:5
#: modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You must be logged in as the {productname} administrator to create and "
"manage organizations."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can also enable staging at the command prompt by editing "
"[path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date``, and adding or editing these lines:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການພັກຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ທີ່ Command prompt ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"
msgstr ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"

#. 2018-12-10, ke: /etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date still exists. @renner confirmed some tools use it (at least, trad. client).  To be renamed in the future.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The ``stagingContentWindow`` parameter is a time value expressed in hours "
"and determines when downloading starts.  It is the number of hours before "
"the scheduled installation or update time.  In this example, content is "
"downloaded 24 hours before the installation time.  The start time for "
"download depends on the selected contact method for a system.  The assigned "
"contact method sets the time for when the next [command]``mgr_check`` is "
"executed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Next time an action is scheduled, packages are automatically downloaded, but "
"not installed.  At the scheduled time, the staged packages are installed."
msgstr "ໃນຄັ້ງຖັດໄປທີ່ມີການກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການ, ແພັກເກດຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແຕ່ຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນຕິດຕັ້ງ. ເມື່ອຮອດເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກພັກໄວ້ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Content Staging"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:11
msgid "There are two parameters used to configure content staging:"
msgstr "ມີສອງຄ່າກຳນົດທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:12
msgid ""
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` is the advance time for the "
"content staging window to open, in hours."
msgstr "[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ແມ່ນເວລາລ່ວງໜ້າທີ່ຈະເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ, ຄິດເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This is the number of hours before installation starts, that package "
"downloads can begin."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດສາມາດເລີ່ມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:14
msgid ""
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` is the duration of the content "
"staging window, in hours."
msgstr "[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` ແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ, ຄິດເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This is the amount of time clients have to stage packages before "
"installation begins."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍມີໃນການພັກຂໍ້ມູນແພັກເກດກ່ອນທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For example, if [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` is set to six "
"hours, and [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` is set to two hours, "
"the staging window opens six hours before the installation time, and remain "
"open for two hours.  No packages are downloaded in the four remaining hours "
"until installation starts."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ແລະ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ໜ້າຕ່າງການພັກຂໍ້ມູນຈະເປີດ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ຈະເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເປັນເວລາ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງ. ຈະບໍ່ມີການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດໃນຊ່ວງ 4 ຊົ່ວໂມງທີ່ເຫຼືອກ່ອນທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you set the same value for both "
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` and "
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` packages are able to be "
"downloaded until installation begins."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນໃຫ້ກັບທັງ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ແລະ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window``, ແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆຈະສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈົນກວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Configure the content staging parameters in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ (content staging) ໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:19
msgid "Default values:"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:20
msgid "[path]``salt_content_staging_advance: 8 hours``"
msgstr "[path]``salt_content_staging_advance: 8 ຊົ່ວໂມງ``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:21
msgid "[path]``salt_content_staging_window: 8 hours``"
msgstr "[path]``salt_content_staging_window: 8 ຊົ່ວໂມງ``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:22
msgid "Content staging must be enabled for these parameters to work correctly."
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ (Content staging) ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ (Custom Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Custom channels give you the ability to create your own software packages "
"and repositories, which you can use to update your clients.  They also allow "
"you to use software provided by third party vendors in your environment."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງແພັກເກດຊອບແວ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍ (clients) ຂອງທ່ານ. ພວກມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຊອບແວທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການພາຍນອກ (third party vendors) ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section gives more detail on how to create, administer, and delete "
"custom channels.  You must have administrator privileges to be able to "
"create and manage custom channels."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການສ້າງ, ການບໍລິຫານ ແລະ ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດທິຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrator) ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating Custom Channels and Repositories"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before you create a custom channel, determine which base channel you want to "
"associate it with, and which repositories you want to use for content."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງມັນກັບຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ (base channel) ໃດ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບໃດສຳລັບເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you have custom software packages that you need to install on your client "
"systems, you can create a custom child channel to manage them.  You need to "
"create the channel in the {productname} {webui} and create a repository for "
"the packages, before assigning the channel to your systems."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີແພັກເກດຊອບແວກຳນົດເອງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channel) ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຈັດການພວກມັນໄດ້. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃນ {productname} {webui} ແລະ ສ້າງຄັງເກັບສຳລັບແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Do not create child channels containing packages that are not compatible "
"with the client system."
msgstr "ຢ່າສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງລູກທີ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can select a vendor channel as the base channel if you want to use "
"packages provided by a vendor.  Alternatively, select ``none`` to make your "
"custom channel a base channel."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channel) ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານໄດ້ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກດທີ່ຜູ້ຜະລິດສະໜອງໃຫ້. ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``none`` ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານກາຍເປັນຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom Channel"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Create Software Channel`` page, give your channel a name "
"(for example, [systemitem]``My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64``) and a label (for "
"example, [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Create Software Channel``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64``) ແລະ ປ້າຍຊື່ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:12
msgid "Labels must not contain spaces or uppercase letters."
msgstr "ປ້າຍຊື່ (Labels) ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent Channel`` drop down, choose the relevant base "
"channel (for example, [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for "
"x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``Parent Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for x86_64``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:14
msgid "Ensure that you choose the compatible parent channel for your packages."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ (parent channel) ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Architecture`` drop down, choose the appropriate hardware "
"architecture (for example, [systemitem]``x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``Architecture``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຮາດແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``x86_64``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Provide any additional information in the contact details, channel access "
"control, and GPG fields, as required for your environment."
msgstr "ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນລາຍລະອຽດການຕິດຕໍ່, ການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ GPG ຕາມທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:17
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Channel]."

#.  We need to create a section on importing GPG keys and change this to point there: https://github.com/SUSE/spacewalk/issues/9474 LKB 2019-09-18
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Custom channels sometimes require additional security settings.  Many third "
"party vendors secure packages with GPG.  If you want to use GPG-protected "
"packages in your custom channel, you need to trust the GPG key which has "
"been used to sign the metadata.  You can then check the [guimenu]``Has "
"Signed Metadata?`` check box to match the package metadata against the "
"trusted GPG keys."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງບາງຄັ້ງຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຜູ້ຜະລິດພາຍນອກຫຼາຍລາຍປົກປ້ອງແພັກເກດດ້ວຍ GPG. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກດທີ່ປົກປ້ອງດ້ວຍ GPG ໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອໝັ້ນຄີ (key) GPG ທີ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໃນການເຊັນຊື່ເມຕາເດຕາ (metadata). ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດໝາຍເລືອກທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?`` ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບເມຕາເດຕາຂອງແພັກເກດກັບຄີ GPG ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້."

#.  This xref is misleading:
#.  For more information on importing GPG keys, see xref:reference:systems/autoinst-gpg-and-ssl-keys.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If remote channels and repositories are signed with GPG keys, you can import "
"and trust these GPG keys.  For example, execute the "
"[command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` from the command line on the {productname} "
"Server:"
msgstr "ຖ້າຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບໄລຍະໄກຖືກເຊັນຊື່ດ້ວຍຄີ GPG, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ເຊື່ອໝັ້ນຄີ GPG ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ໃນ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The underlying [command]``zypper`` call will import the key, if it is "
"available.  The {webui} does not offer this feature."
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [command]``zypper`` ພື້ນຖານຈະນຳເຂົ້າຄີ ຫາກມີຄີຢູ່. ສ່ວນ {webui} ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This only works when the repository you want to mirror is set up in a "
"special way and provide the \"key\" in the repository next to the "
"signature.  This is the case for all repositories generated by the Open "
"Build Service (OBS).  For other repositories special preparation steps are "
"needed (see below!)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:23
msgid ""
"By default, the ``Enable GPG Check`` field is checked when you create a new "
"channel.  If you would like to add custom packages and applications to your "
"channel, make sure you uncheck this field to be able to install unsigned "
"packages.  Disabling the GPG check is a security risk if packages are from "
"an untrusted source."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ ``Enable GPG Check`` ຈະຖືກໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັນຊື່ໄດ້. ການປິດການກວດສອບ GPG ແມ່ນມີຄວາມສ່ຽງດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ ຫາກແພັກເກດມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If you are registering traditional {rhel}{nbsp}7 or SLES {es}{nbsp}7 clients "
"you might notice errors with unsigned packages.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can only add a repository to the {productname} with the {webui} if it is "
"a valid software repository.  Check in advance that needed repository "
"metadata are available.  Tools such as [command]``createrepo`` and "
"[command]``reprepro`` are useful in this regard.  [command]``mgrpush`` can "
"help with pushing a single RPM into a channel without creating a "
"repository.  For more information, see the man pages for "
"[literal]``createrepo_c`` and [literal]``reprepro``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a Software Repository"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Repositories], and click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Repositories], ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:28
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Create Repository`` page, give your repository a label "
"(for example, [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo``)."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Create Repository``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Repository URL`` field, provide the path to the directory "
"that contains the [path]``repodata`` file (for example, "
"[systemitem]``file:///opt/mytools/``).  You can use any valid addressing "
"protocol in this field."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Repository URL``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ [path]``repodata`` (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``file:///opt/mytools/``). ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນຊ່ອງນີ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:30
msgid "Uncheck the [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?`` check box."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍເລືອກທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:31
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Complete the SSL fields if your repository requires client "
"certificate authentication."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ SSL ຫາກຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນລູກຂ່າຍ (client certificate)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:32
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The above procedure only works if the repository you want to mirror provides "
"the \"key\" in the repository next to the signature.  This is the case for "
"all repositories generated by the OBS, but it is typically not the case for "
"other repos of operating systems that are not offered by the OBS."
msgstr ""

#.  Not sure how it is possible to import the key into the RPM DB which is used for syncing.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:34
msgid ""
"If the repository you want to use does not have a GPG key you can provide "
"one yourself and import the GPG key into the keyring manually.  If you "
"import the key into the [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir`` keyring using "
"the [command]``gpg`` commandline tool it would be stored permanently.  The "
"key would also persist if the chroot environment would be cleaned."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Software Repository with GPG Key"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:36
msgid "The gpg command to import a key into the pub keyring is:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --import /path/to/gpg.key\n"
msgstr ""

#.  Using gpg is horrible. You need to find out the keyid, you need to trust "ultimately" and save the change.
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Add Debian non-flat repositories using ``uyuni_suite``, ``uyuni_component``, "
"and ``uyuni_arch`` query parameters."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບ Debian ແບບ non-flat ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງ ``uyuni_suite``, ``uyuni_component``, ແລະ ``uyuni_arch``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_suite``"
msgstr "``uyuni_suite``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:40
msgid ""
"is mandatory.  In Debian documentation, this is also known as "
"[literal]``distribution``.  With this parameter you specify the apt source.  "
"Without this parameter the original approach is used.  If the parameter ends "
"with ``/``, the repository is identified as flat."
msgstr "ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ. ໃນເອກະສານຂອງ Debian, ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ [literal]``distribution``. ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ ທ່ານຈະລະບຸແຫຼ່ງ apt source. ຫາກບໍ່ມີພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ ຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການແບບເດີມ. ຫາກພາຣາມິເຕີລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ ``/``, ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກລະບຸວ່າເປັນແບບ flat."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_component``"
msgstr "``uyuni_component``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:42
msgid ""
"is optional.  This parameter can specify only one component.  It is not "
"possible to list the components.  An apt source entry allows to specify "
"multiple components, but for Uyuni it is not possible.  Instead you must "
"create separate repository for each component."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_arch``"
msgstr "``uyuni_arch``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:44
msgid ""
"is optional.  If omitted the architecture name is calculated with a SQL "
"query for the channel from the database.  Specify ``uyuni_arch`` explicitly "
"if it does not match the architecture of the channel (sometimes architecture "
"naming is ambiguous)."
msgstr "ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ຫາກລະເວັ້ນໄວ້ ຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຈະຖືກຄຳນວນດ້ວຍ SQL query ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຫ້ລະບຸ ``uyuni_arch`` ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ ຫາກມັນບໍ່ກົງກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ (ບາງຄັ້ງການຕັ້ງຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳອາດຈະກຳກວມ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:45
msgid "Here are some examples:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງບາງສ່ວນ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debian non-flat repository mapping"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ຄັງເກັບ Debian ແບບ non-flat"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type             | Source line / URL\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/``\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"``https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/``\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable "
"main``\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"``https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ປະເພດ            | ບັນທັດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ / URL\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/``\n"
"| URL mapping      | ``https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/``\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main``\n"
"| URL mapping      | ``https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main``\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Find here background information about the Debian repository definition "
"format.  This information is based on "
"https://wiki.debian.org/DebianRepository/Format#Overview."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:49
msgid "The repository definition format is as follows:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"
msgstr "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main\n"
msgstr "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/dists stable main\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:53
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:5
msgid "or"
msgstr "ຫຼື"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"
msgstr "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:55
msgid ""
"For each pair of ``suite`` and ``component`` the spezification defines a "
"distinct URL calculated on the base URL ``+ suite + component``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄູ່ຂອງ ``suite`` ແລະ ``component``, ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຈະກຳນົດ URL ທີ່ແຍກກັນ ເຊິ່ງຄຳນວນຈາກ URL ພື້ນຖານ ``+ suite + component``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the Repository to a Channel"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Assign your new repository to your custom channel by navigating to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels], clicking the name of your newly created "
"custom channel, and navigating to the [guimenu]``Repositories`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Ensure the repository you want to assign to the channel is checked, and "
"click btn:[Update Repositories]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Sync`` tab and click btn:[Sync Now] to "
"synchronize immediately. For more information about channel synchronization, "
"see below."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Custom Channels to an Activation Key"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:61
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys], and "
"select the key you want to add the custom channel to."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys], ແລ້ວເລືອກຄີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:62
msgid ""
"On the [guiemnu]``Details`` tab, in the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` listing, "
"select the channel to associate."
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ [guimenu]``Details``, ໃນລາຍການ [guimenu]``Child Channels``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:63
msgid "You can select multiple channels, if you need to."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ ຫາກຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:64
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Activation Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom channel synchronization"
msgstr "ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To avoid missing important updates, {suse} recommends to keep your custom "
"channels up to date with the remote repositories changes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການພາດການອັບເດດທີ່ສຳຄັນ, {suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຮັກສາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີ ຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຄັງເກັບໄລຍະໄກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:67
msgid ""
"By default, custom channels are not synchronized automatically. In order to "
"keep a custom channel up to date, you need to:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:68
msgid ""
"synchronize it manually by navigating to the [guimenu]``Sync`` tab and click "
"btn:[Sync Now],"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Sync`` ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Sync Now],"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:69
msgid ""
"set up an automated synchronization schedule from the "
"[guimenu]``Repositories`` tab."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າກຳນົດເວລາການປັບຂໍ້ມູນອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກແທັບ [guimenu]``Repositories``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:70
msgid ""
"It is also possible to enable automatic synchronization for all the custom "
"channels you create. To do this, set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.unify_custom_channel_management = 1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:72
msgid "With this property turned on, a synchronization will happen automatically:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:73
msgid ""
"after adding a repository to a channel from the UI or by using "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels``"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຜ່ານ UI ຫຼື ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:74
msgid ""
"as part of the daily task ``mgr-sync-refresh-default``, which will "
"synchronize all your custom and vendor channels."
msgstr "ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໜ້າວຽກປະຈຳວັນ ``mgr-sync-refresh-default``, ເຊິ່ງຈະປັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໃຫ້ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:75
msgid ""
"When the process is started, there are several ways to check if a channel "
"has finished synchronizing:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂະບວນການເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ສຳເລັດການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:76
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and "
"select the [guimenu]``Products`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard] ແລ້ວເລືອກແທັບ [guimenu]``Products``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:77
msgid ""
"This dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being "
"synchronized."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖບສະຖານະຄວາມສຳເລັດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"then click the channel associated to the repository."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:[Repositories > Sync] tab.  The [guimenu]``Sync "
"Status`` is shown next to the repository name.."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:80
msgid "Check the synchronization log file at the command prompt:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (log file) ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນຜ່ານ command prompt:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Each child channel generates its own log during the synchronization "
"progress.  You need to check all the base and child channel log files to be "
"sure that the synchronization is complete."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງລູກຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການປັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງທັງຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງລູກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການປັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Packages and Patches to Custom Channels"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:84
msgid ""
"When you create a new custom channel without cloning it from an existing "
"channel, it does not contain any packages or patches.  You can add the "
"packages and patches you require using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ໂຄລນ (cloning) ມາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດໃດໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:85
msgid ""
"Custom channels can only include packages or patches that are cloned or "
"custom, and they must match the base architecture of the channel.  Patches "
"added to custom channels must apply to a package that exists in the channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງສາມາດມີໄດ້ສະເພາະແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ ຫຼື ກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ພວກມັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳພື້ນຖານຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ. ແພັດທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກັບແພັກເກດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Packages to Custom Channels"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:87
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the [guimenu]``Packages`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Packages``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:88
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all packages currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"[guimenu]``List/Remove`` tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເບິ່ງແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``List/Remove``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:89
msgid "Add new packages to the channel by navigating to the [guimenu]``Add`` tab."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Add``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:90
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide packages, and click btn:[View Packages] "
"to populate the list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ທີ່ຈະສະໜອງແພັກເກດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[View Packages] ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Check the packages to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Add "
"Packages]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Add Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:92
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm Addition] to "
"add the packages to the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບການເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm Addition] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັກເກດເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:93
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: You can compare the packages in the current channel with those in "
"a different channel by navigating to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], and "
"going to the menu:Packages[Compare] tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ທ່ານສາມາດປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດໃນຊ່ອງທາງປັດຈຸບັນກັບແພັກເກດໃນຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໄດ້ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ ເມນູ: Packages[Compare]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:94
msgid ""
"To make the two channels the same, click the btn:[Merge Differences] button, "
"and resolve any conflicts."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ທັງສອງຊ່ອງທາງຄືກັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Merge Differences], ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃດໆ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Patches to a Custom Channel"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:96
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the [guimenu]``Patches`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Patches``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:97
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all patches currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"[guimenu]``List/Remove`` tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເບິ່ງແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``List/Remove``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:98
msgid ""
"Add new patches to the channel by navigating to the [guimenu]``Add`` tab, "
"and selecting what kind of patches you want to add."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັດໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Add``, ແລະ ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງແພັດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:99
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide patches, and click btn:[View Associated "
"Patches] to populate the list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ທີ່ຈະສະໜອງແພັດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[View Associated Patches] ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:100
msgid "Check the patches to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກແພັດທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:101
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm] to add the "
"patches to the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບການເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັດເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Custom Channels"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:103
msgid ""
"{productname} administrators and channel administrators can alter or delete "
"any channel."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:104
msgid ""
"To grant other users rights to alter or delete a channel, navigate to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels] and select the channel you want to edit.  "
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Managers`` tab, and check the user to grant "
"permissions.  Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອມອບສິດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels] ແລ້ວເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ. ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Managers``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຈະມອບສິດໃຫ້. ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:105
msgid ""
"If you delete a channel that has been assigned to a set of clients, it "
"triggers an immediate update of the channel state for any clients associated "
"with the deleted channel.  This is to ensure that the changes are reflected "
"accurately in the repository file."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍໄວ້, ມັນຈະກະຕຸ້ນການອັບເດດສະຖານະຊ່ອງທາງທັນທີສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍໃດໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບນັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກສະທ້ອນໃຫ້ເຫັນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໄຟລ໌ຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:106
msgid ""
"You cannot delete {productname} channels with the {webui}.  Only custom "
"channels can be deleted."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {webui} ໄດ້. ມີພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Custom Channels"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:108
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and select the channel you want to delete."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:109
msgid "Click btn:[Delete software channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete software channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:110
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Delete Channel`` page, check the details of the channel "
"you are deleting, and check the [guimenu]``Unsubscribe Systems`` checkbox to "
"remove the custom channel from any systems that might still be subscribed."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Delete Channel``, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຈະລຶບ, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Unsubscribe Systems`` ເພື່ອຖອນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກລະບົບໃດໆທີ່ອາດຈະຍັງສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:111
msgid "Click btn:[Delete Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:112
msgid ""
"When channels are deleted, the packages that are part of the deleted channel "
"are not automatically removed.  You are not able to update packages that "
"have had their channel deleted."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງຖືກລຶບ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຖອນອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດແພັກເກດທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງພວກມັນຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:113
msgid ""
"You can delete packages that are not associated with a channel in the "
"{productname} {webui}.  Navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Packages], check "
"the packages to remove, and click btn:[Delete Packages]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໆໃນ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Packages], ໝາຍເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະຖອນອອກ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete Packages]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disconnected Setup"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Disconnected Setup)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When it is not possible to connect {productname} to the internet, you can "
"use it within a disconnected environment."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} ກັບອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ງານມັນພາຍໃຕ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The repository mirroring tool (RMT) is available on {sle}{nbsp}15 and "
"later.  RMT replaces the subscription management tool (SMT), which can be "
"used on older {sle} installations."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື Repository Mirroring Tool (RMT) ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {sle} 15 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ.  RMT ມາແທນທີ່ Subscription Management Tool (SMT) ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In a disconnected {productname} setup, RMT or SMT uses an external network "
"to connect to {scc}.  All software channels and repositories are "
"synchronized to a removable storage device.  The storage device can then be "
"used to update the disconnected {productname} installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This setup allows your {productname} installation to remain in an offline, "
"disconnected environment."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບອອບລາຍ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Your RMT or SMT instance must be used to manage the {productname} Server "
"directly.  It cannot be used to manage a second RMT or SMT instance, in a "
"cascade."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) RMT ຫຼື SMT ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການ {productname} Server ໂດຍກົງ. ບໍ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ຫຼື SMT ອັນທີສອງແບບຕໍ່ກັນເປັນທອດໆ (cascade) ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on RMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-rmt.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize RMT"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນ RMT ໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can use RMT on {sle} 15 installations to manage clients running {sle} 12 "
"or later."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ RMT ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle} 15 ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"We recommend you set up a dedicated RMT instance for each {productname} "
"installation."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up RMT"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:12
msgid "On the RMT instance, install the RMT package:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ RMT:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in rmt-server\n"
msgstr "zypper in rmt-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:14
msgid "Configure RMT using {yast}:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ RMT ໂດຍໃຊ້ {yast}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 rmt\n"
msgstr "yast2 rmt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:16
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete installation."
msgstr "ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information on setting up RMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/book-rmt.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing RMT with SCC"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"On the RMT instance, list all available products and repositories for your "
"organization:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບທັງໝົດທີ່ມີສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:21
msgid "Synchronize all available updates for your organization:"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນການອັບເດດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ກົງກັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli sync\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:23
msgid "You can also configure RMT to synchronize regularly using systemd."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າ RMT ໃຫ້ປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີໂດຍໃຊ້ systemd."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:24
msgid "Enable the products you require."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:25
msgid "For example, to enable SLES 15:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ SLES 15:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:27
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:40
msgid "Export the synchronized data to your removable storage."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກ (export) ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ປັບແລ້ວໄປຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:28
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:41
msgid "In this example, the storage medium is mounted at [path]``/mnt/usb``:"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເມົາທ໌ (mount) ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/mnt/usb``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:30
msgid "Export the enabled repositories to your removable storage:"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກຄັງເກັບທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວໄປຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change RMT user settings in the `cli` section of "
"[path]``/etc/rmt.conf``."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກເມົາທ໌ໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ສາມາດຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ `cli` ຂອງ [path]``/etc/rmt.conf``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize SMT"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນ SMT ໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:34
msgid ""
"SMT is included with {sle} 12, and can be used to manage clients running "
"{sle} 10 or later."
msgstr "SMT ມາພ້ອມກັບ {sle} 12, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 10 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:35
msgid ""
"SMT requires you to create a local mirror directory on the SMT instance to "
"synchronize repositories and packages."
msgstr "SMT ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງໂຟນເດີມິເຣີພາຍໃນ (local mirror) ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SMT ເພື່ອປັບຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບ ແລະ ແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For more details on installing and configuring SMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SMT, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing SMT with SCC"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:38
msgid "On the SMT instance, create a database replacement file:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SMT, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທົດແທນ (database replacement file):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"
msgstr "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/suma/product_tree.json -o "
"/mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"
msgstr ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/suma/product_tree.json -o /mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change SMT user settings in "
"[path]``/etc/smt.conf``."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກເມົາທ໌ໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ສາມາດຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ SMT ໄດ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/smt.conf``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The corresponding {productname} Client Tools Channels are required, for "
"{productname} to be able to synchronize a given channel.  If these channels "
"are not enabled, {productname} may fail to detect that product."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {productname} Client Tools ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ສາມາດປັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກົງກັນໄດ້. ຫາກຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, {productname} ອາດຈະກວດບໍ່ພົບຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Run the following command to enable these mandatory channels:"
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 12 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 12 ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ SLES 12 ເຊັ່ນ SLES for SAP ຫຼື SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:48
msgid "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64``"
msgstr "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:49
msgid "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64``"
msgstr "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 15 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 15 ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ SLES 15 ເຊັ່ນ SLES for SAP ຫຼື SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:51
msgid "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64``"
msgstr "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:52
msgid "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64``"
msgstr "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:53
msgid "Then mirror the channels, and export."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ເຮັດມິເຣີຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Other distributions, or architectures, can be enabled.  For more information "
"about enabling product channels or repositories to be mirrored, see the "
"documentation:"
msgstr "ການແຈກຢາຍ (distributions) ຫຼື ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳອື່ນໆ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເປີດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບທີ່ຈະເຮັດມິເຣີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ເອກະສານ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "RMT"
msgstr "RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:56
msgid "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-rmt-mirroring.html#sec-rmt-mirroring-enable-disable"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "SMT"
msgstr "SMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:58
msgid "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/single-html/SLES-smt/index.html#smt-mirroring-manage-domirror"
msgstr "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/single-html/SLES-smt/index.html#smt-mirroring-manage-domirror"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize a Disconnected Server"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"When you have removable media loaded with your {scc} data, you can use it to "
"synchronize your disconnected server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing a Disconnected Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນເຊີບເວີແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:62
msgid "Mount your removable media device to the {productname} server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:63
msgid "In this example, the mount point is [path]``/media/disk``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Open ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and define the mount point by adding or editing "
"this line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.susemanager.fromdir = /media/disk\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:66
msgid "Restart the Tomcat service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມລະບົບການບໍລິການ Tomcat ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart tomcat\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart tomcat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:68
msgid "Refresh the local data:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh) ຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync refresh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:70
msgid "Perform a synchronization:"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-sync list channels\n"
"mgr-sync add channel channel-label\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:72
msgid ""
"The removable disk that you use for synchronization must always be available "
"at the same mount point.  Do not trigger a synchronization, if the storage "
"medium is not mounted.  This results in data corruption."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Be aware that if [literal]``server.susemanager.fromdir`` is set, "
"{productname} will not be able to check if {scc} credentials are valid or "
"not.  Instead, a warning sign will be displayed and no SCC online check will "
"be performed."
msgstr ""

