msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:14
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The containers feature is available for {salt} clients running {sles} 12 or "
"later.  Before you begin, ensure your environment meets these requirements:"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຄອນເທນເນີແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານກົງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"A published git repository containing a Dockerfile and configuration "
"scripts.  The repository can be public or private, and should be hosted on "
"GitHub, GitLab, or BitBucket."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບ git ທີ່ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ ເຊິ່ງມີ Dockerfile ແລະ ສະຄຣິບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ຄັງເກັບສາມາດເປັນແບບສາທາລະນະ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕົວ ແລະ ຄວນຈະຢູ່ເທິງ GitHub, GitLab ຫຼື BitBucket."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:17
msgid "A properly configured image store, such as a Docker registry."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ເຊິ່ງເປັນ Docker registry."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information on Containers, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/container/all/html/Container-guide/[https://documentation.suse.com/container/all/html/Container-guide/]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:19
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a build host"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ (build host)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To build images with {productname}, you need to create and configure a build "
"host.  Container build hosts are {salt} clients running {sle} 12 or later.  "
"This section guides you through the initial configuration for a build host."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ດ້ວຍ {productname}, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ (build host). ໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ຄອນເທນເນີແມ່ນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:21
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:149
msgid ""
"The operating system on the build host must match the operating system on "
"the targeted image."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ ຕ້ອງກົງກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນອິເມຈ໌ເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:22
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:150
msgid ""
"For example, build {sles}{nbsp}15 based images on a build host running "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 or later) OS version.  Build {sles}{nbsp}12 based images "
"on a build host running {sles}{nbsp}12 SP5 or {sles}{nbsp}12 SP4 OS version."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຫ້ສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {sles} 15 ໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles} 15 (SP2 ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ). ແລະ ສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {sles} 12 ໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles} 12 SP5 ຫຼື {sles} 12 SP4."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:23
msgid "Cross-architecture builds are not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສ້າງແບບຂ້າມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (Cross-architecture builds)."

#. 2022-05-12, ke: at least for now, according to feedback, this is unsupported:
#. For example, you must build Raspberry Pi {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 images on a Raspberry Pi (aarch64 architecture) build host running {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3.
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:24
msgid ""
"From the {productname} {webui}, perform these steps to configure a build "
"host:"
msgstr "ຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a host"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການບິວດ໌ໂຮສ"

#. BEGIN Procedure
#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Select a {salt} client to be designated as a build host from the "
"menu:Systems[Overview] page."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:27
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``System Details`` page of the selected client assign the "
"containers modules.  Go to menu:Software[Software Channels] and enable the "
"containers module (for example, [guimenu]``SLE-Module-Containers15-Pool`` "
"and [guimenu]``SLE-Module-Containers15-Updates``).  Confirm by clicking "
"btn:[Change Subscriptions]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:28
msgid ""
"From the menu:System Details[Properties] page, enable ``Container Build "
"Host`` from the [guimenu]``Add-on System Types`` list.  Confirm by clicking "
"btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Install all required packages by applying ``Highstate``.  From the system "
"details page select menu:States[Highstate] and click [guimenu]``Apply "
"Highstate``.  Alternatively, apply Highstate from the {productname} Server "
"command line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:30
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '$your_client' state.highstate\n"
msgstr "salt '$your_client' state.highstate\n"

#. END Procedure
#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key for containers"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key) ສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The containers built using {productname} use channels associated to the "
"activation key as repositories when building the image.  This section guides "
"you through creating an ad-hoc activation key for this purpose."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:33
msgid ""
"To build a container, you need an activation key that is associated with a "
"channel other than `SUSE Manager Default`."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຄອນເທນເນີ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ `SUSE Manager Default`."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:34
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:178
#, no-wrap
msgid "systems_create_activation_key.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:35
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:179
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an activation key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:36
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ ເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:37
msgid "Click btn:[Create Key]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Enter a [guimenu]``Description`` and a [guimenu]``Key`` name.  Use the "
"drop-down menu to select the [guimenu]``Base Channel`` to associate with "
"this key."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Description`` (ຄຳອະທິບາຍ) ແລະ ຊື່ [guimenu]``Key``. ໃຊ້ລາຍການເລືອກເພື່ອເລືອກ [guimenu]``Base Channel`` ທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄີນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:39
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:183
msgid "Confirm with btn:[Create Activation Key]."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນໂດຍຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Activation Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:40
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:184
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:41
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:185
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an image store"
msgstr "ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ (image store)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:42
msgid ""
"All built images are pushed to an image store.  This section contains "
"information about creating an image store."
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_image_stores.png"
msgstr "images_image_stores.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating image store"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:45
msgid "Select menu:Images[Stores]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ ເມນູ: Images[Stores]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:46
msgid "Click [guimenu]``Create`` to create a new store."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ [guimenu]``Create`` ເພື່ອສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໃໝ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_image_stores_create.png"
msgstr "images_image_stores_create.png"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:48
msgid "Define a name for the image store in the [guimenu]``Label`` field."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຊື່ສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Provide the path to your image registry by filling in the [guimenu]``URI`` "
"field, as a fully qualified domain name (FQDN) for the container registry "
"host (whether internal or external)."
msgstr "ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ image registry ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``URI`` ເປັນຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (FQDN) ສຳລັບໂຮສຂອງ container registry (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນພາຍໃນ ຫຼື ພາຍນອກ)."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "registry.example.com\n"
msgstr "registry.example.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The Registry URI can also be used to specify an image store on a registry "
"that is already in use."
msgstr "Registry URI ຍັງສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ໃນເຣຈິສທຣີທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "registry.example.com:5000/myregistry/myproject\n"
msgstr "registry.example.com:5000/myregistry/myproject\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:53
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to add the new image store."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:54
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:190
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an image profile"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ (image profile)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:55
msgid ""
"All container images are built using an image profile, which contains the "
"building instructions.  This section contains information about creating an "
"image profile with the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ທຸກອິເມຈ໌ຄອນເທນເນີຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ ເຊິ່ງມີຄຳແນະນຳໃນການສ້າງ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ດ້ວຍ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:56
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:192
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_image_profiles.png"
msgstr "images_image_profiles.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an image profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:58
msgid ""
"To create an image profile select menu:Images[Profiles] and click "
"btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ເມນູ: Images[Profiles] ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_image_create_profile.png"
msgstr "images_image_create_profile.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Provide a name for the image profile by filling in the [guimenu]``Label`` "
"field."
msgstr "ລະບຸຊື່ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ໂດຍຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If your container image tag is in a format such as `myproject/myimage`, make "
"sure your image store registry URI contains the `/myproject` suffix."
msgstr "ຫາກແທັກອິເມຈ໌ຄອນເທນເນີຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບເຊັ່ນ `myproject/myimage`, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ registry URI ຂອງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ນັ້ນມີຄຳລົງທ້າຍວ່າ `/myproject`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:62
msgid "Use a Dockerfile as the `Image Type`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Use the drop-down menu to select your registry from the `Target Image Store` "
"field."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:64
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Path`` field, type a GitHub, GitLab or BitBucket "
"repository URL.  The URL should be be http, https, or a token authentication "
"URL.  Use one of these formats:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitHub Path Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງ GitHub"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:66
msgid "GitHub single user project repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄົນດຽວໃນ GitHub"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/USER/project.git#branchname:folder\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/USER/project.git#branchname:folder\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:68
msgid "GitHub organization project repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງອົງກອນໃນ GitHub"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/ORG/project.git#branchname:folder\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/ORG/project.git#branchname:folder\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:70
msgid "GitHub token authentication"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍ token ຂອງ GitHub"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:71
msgid ""
"If your git repository is private, modify the profile's URL to include "
"authentication.  Use this URL format to authenticate with a GitHub token:"
msgstr "ຫາກຄັງເກັບ git ຂອງທ່ານເປັນແບບສ່ວນຕົວ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ URL ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອລວມເອົາການກວດສອບສິດ. ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ URL ນີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ token ຂອງ GitHub:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://USER:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@github.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://USER:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@github.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitLab Path Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງ GitLab"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:74
msgid "GitLab single user project repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄົນດຽວໃນ GitLab"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:76
msgid "GitLab groups project repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງກຸ່ມໃນ GitLab"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab.example.com/GROUP/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab.example.com/GROUP/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:78
msgid "GitLab token authentication"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍ token ຂອງ GitLab"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:79
msgid ""
"If your git repository is private and not publicly accessible, you need to "
"modify the profile's git URL to include authentication.  Use this URL format "
"to authenticate with a GitLab token:"
msgstr "ຫາກຄັງເກັບ git ຂອງທ່ານເປັນແບບສ່ວນຕົວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ແບບສາທາລະນະ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ git URL ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອລວມເອົາການກວດສອບສິດ. ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ URL ນີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ token ຂອງ GitLab:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab-ci-token:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab-ci-token:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:81
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a git branch, the `master` branch is used by default.  "
"If a `folder` is not specified, the image sources (Dockerfile sources) are "
"expected to be in the root directory of the GitHub or GitLab checkout."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ລະບຸ git branch, ລະບົບຈະໃຊ້ branch `master` ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລະບຸ `folder`, ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອິເມຈ໌ (Dockerfile sources) ຈະຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີຮາກ (root directory) ຂອງ GitHub ຫຼື GitLab."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Select an `Activation Key`.  Activation keys ensure that images using a "
"profile are assigned to the correct channel and packages."
msgstr "ເລືອກ `Activation Key`. ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:83
msgid ""
"When you associate an activation key with an image profile you are ensuring "
"any image using the profile uses the correct software channel and any "
"packages in the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌, ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ແພັກເກດໃດໆທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:84
msgid "Click the btn:[Create] button."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Dockerfile sources"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ Dockerfile"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:86
msgid ""
"An Image Profile that can be reused is published at "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:87
msgid ""
"The [option]``ARG`` parameters ensure that the built image is associated "
"with the desired repository served by {productname}.  The [option]``ARG`` "
"parameters also allow you to build image versions of {sles} which may differ "
"from the version of {sles} used by the build host itself."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ [option]``ARG`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນນັ້ນເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄັງເກັບທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ {productname}. ພາຣາມິເຕີ [option]``ARG`` ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ເວີຊັນຂອງ {sles} ທີ່ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກເວີຊັນຂອງ {sles} ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ເອງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:88
msgid ""
"For example: The [command]``ARG repo`` parameter and the [command]``echo`` "
"command pointing to the repository file, creates and then injects the "
"correct path into the repository file for the desired channel version."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ພາຣາມິເຕີ [command]``ARG repo`` ແລະ ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``echo`` ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຄັງເກັບ ຈະສ້າງ ແລະ ແຊກເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຄັງເກັບສຳລັບເວີຊັນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:89
msgid ""
"The repository is determined by the activation key that you assigned to your "
"image profile."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FROM registry.example.com/sles12sp2\n"
"MAINTAINER Tux Administrator \"tux@example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""
"FROM registry.example.com/sles12sp2\n"
"MAINTAINER Tux Administrator \"tux@example.com\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "### Begin: These lines Required for use with {productname}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ARG repo\n"
"ARG cert\n"
msgstr ""
"ARG repo\n"
"ARG cert\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the correct certificate\n"
"RUN echo \"$cert\" > /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.pem\n"
msgstr ""
"# Add the correct certificate\n"
"RUN echo \"$cert\" > /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.pem\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Update certificate trust store\n"
"RUN update-ca-certificates\n"
msgstr ""
"# Update certificate trust store\n"
"RUN update-ca-certificates\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the repository path to the image\n"
"RUN echo \"$repo\" > /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"
msgstr ""
"# Add the repository path to the image\n"
"RUN echo \"$repo\" > /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "### End: These lines required for use with {productname}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the package script\n"
"ADD add_packages.sh /root/add_packages.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"# Add the package script\n"
"ADD add_packages.sh /root/add_packages.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Run the package script\n"
"RUN /root/add_packages.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"# Run the package script\n"
"RUN /root/add_packages.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# After building remove the repository path from image\n"
"RUN rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"
msgstr ""
"# After building remove the repository path from image\n"
"RUN rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"

#. TODO: Replace the "custom-system-info" link
#. type: Title ====
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using custom info key-value pairs as Docker `buildargs`"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າ (key-value) ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງເປັນ `buildargs` ຂອງ Docker"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:101
msgid ""
"You can assign custom info key-value pairs to attach information to the "
"image profiles.  Additionally, these key-value pairs are passed to the "
"Docker build command as `buildargs`."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແນບຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາຄຳສັ່ງ build ຂອງ Docker ໃນຮູບແບບ `buildargs`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:102
msgid ""
"For more information about the available custom info keys and creating "
"additional ones, see xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄີຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ແລະ ການສ້າງຄີເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:103
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:232
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an image"
msgstr "ສ້າງອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:104
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build an image.  You can select menu:Images[Build] "
"from the left navigation bar, or click the build icon in the "
"menu:Images[Profiles] list."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການສ້າງອິເມຈ໌. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກ ເມນູ: Images[Build] ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ຫຼື ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນບິວດ໌ໃນລາຍການ ເມນູ: Images[Profiles]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:105
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:234
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_image_build.png"
msgstr "images_image_build.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:106
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:235
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building an image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:107
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:236
msgid "Select menu:Images[Build]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ ເມນູ: Images[Build]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"``latest`` (only relevant to containers)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊື່ແທັກ (tag name) ອື່ນ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ ``latest`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະເພາະກັບຄອນເທນເນີເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:109
msgid "Select [guimenu]``Build Profile`` and [guimenu]``Build Host``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Build Profile`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Build Host``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Notice the [guimenu]``Profile Summary`` to the right of the build fields.  "
"When you have selected a build profile, detailed information about the "
"selected profile is displayed in this area."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ສັງເກດ [guimenu]``Profile Summary`` ທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສ້າງແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນບໍລິເວນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:111
msgid "To schedule a build click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການສ້າງ ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import an image"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:113
msgid ""
"You can import and inspect arbitrary images.  Select menu:Images[Image List] "
"from the left navigation bar.  Complete the text boxes of the "
"[guimenu]``Import`` dialog.  When it has processed, the imported image is "
"listed on the [guimenu]``Image List`` page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing an image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:115
msgid ""
"From menu:Images[Image list] click btn:[Import] to open the "
"[guimenu]``Import Image`` dialog."
msgstr "ຈາກ ເມນູ: Images[Image list] ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Import] ເພື່ອເປີດກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Import Image``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:116
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Import Image`` dialog complete these fields:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Import Image`` ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image store"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:118
msgid "The registry from where the image is pulled for inspection."
msgstr "ເຣຈິສທຣີທີ່ຈະດຶງ (pull) ອິເມຈ໌ມາເພື່ອການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image name"
msgstr "ຊື່ອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:120
msgid "The name of the image in the registry."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງອິເມຈ໌ໃນເຣຈິສທຣີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image version"
msgstr "ເວີຊັນອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:122
msgid "The version of the image in the registry."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຂອງອິເມຈ໌ໃນເຣຈິສທຣີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build host"
msgstr "ໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:124
msgid "The build host that pulls and inspects the image."
msgstr "ໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ທີ່ຈະດຶງ ແລະ ກວດສອບອິເມຈ໌."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation key"
msgstr "ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:126
msgid ""
"The activation key that provides the path to the software channel that the "
"image is inspected with."
msgstr "ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບອິເມຈ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:127
msgid "For confirmation, click btn:[Import]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Import]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:128
msgid ""
"The entry for the image is created in the database, and an ``Inspect Image`` "
"action on {productname} is scheduled."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງອິເມຈ໌ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ການດຳເນີນການ ``Inspect Image`` (ກວດສອບອິເມຈ໌) ໃນ {productname} ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:129
msgid ""
"When it has been processed, you can find the imported image in the ``Image "
"List``.  It has a different icon in the ``Build`` column, to indicate that "
"the image is imported.  The status icon for the imported image can also be "
"seen on the ``Overview`` tab for the image."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມັນຖືກປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຊອກຫາຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ໃນ ``ລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບ``. ມັນມີໄອຄອນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນຖັນ ``ບິວດ໌ (Build)``, ເພື່ອສະແດງວ່າຮູບພາບນັ້ນຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ. ໄອຄອນສະຖານະສຳລັບຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຍັງສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນແຖບ ``ພາບລວມ (Overview)`` ສຳລັບຮູບພາບນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:130
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:252
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:131
msgid "These are some known problems when working with images:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງບັນຫາທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນເວລານຳໃຊ້ຮູບພາບ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:132
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates to access the registry or the git repositories should be "
"deployed to the client by a custom state file."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ HTTPS ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງເຣຈິດສະຕຣີ (registry) ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບ git ຄວນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໄຄລເອັນໂດຍໄຟລ໌ສະຖານະ (state file) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:133
msgid "SSH git access using Docker is currently unsupported."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH git ໂດຍໃຊ້ Docker ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບໃນເວລານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "OS images"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS images)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:135
msgid ""
"OS Images are built by the Kiwi image system.  The output image is "
"customizable and can be PXE, QCOW2, LiveCD, or other types of images."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:136
msgid ""
"For more information about the Kiwi build system, see the "
"https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/kiwi/doc/[https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/kiwi/doc/]."
msgstr ""

#. SLE15 images support is not yet released for SUMA4, but is part of SUMA4.0.4 as tech preview
#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:138
msgid ""
"The Kiwi image building feature is available for {salt} clients running "
"{sles}{nbsp}12 and {sles}{nbsp}11."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດການສ້າງຮູບພາບ Kiwi ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນ {salt} ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ {sles}{nbsp}12 ແລະ {sles}{nbsp}11."

#. From {sles}{nbsp}15, ``kiwi-ng`` is used instead of the legacy Kiwi.
#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:139
msgid ""
"Kiwi image configuration files and configuration scripts must be accessible "
"in one of these locations:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຮູບພາບ Kiwi ແລະ ສະຄຣິບກຳນົດຄ່າຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນໜຶ່ງໃນສະຖານທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:140
msgid "Git repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບ Git"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:141
msgid "HTTP hosted tarball"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:142
msgid "Local build host directory"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:143
msgid ""
"For an example of a complete Kiwi repository served by git, see "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage[https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:144
msgid ""
"You need at least 1{nbsp}GB of RAM available for hosts running OS Images "
"built with Kiwi.  Disk space depends on the actual size of the image.  For "
"more information, see the documentation of the underlying system."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີ RAM ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1{nbsp}GB ສຳລັບໂຮສທີ່ໃຊ້ຮູບພາບ OS ທີ່ບິວດ໌ດ້ວຍ Kiwi. ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດຕົວຈິງຂອງຮູບພາບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:145
msgid ""
"The build host must be a {salt} client.  Do not install the build host as a "
"traditional client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:147
msgid ""
"To build all kinds of images with {productname}, create and configure a "
"build host.  OS Image build hosts are {salt} clients running on "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 or later) or {sles}{nbsp}12 (SP4 or later)."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບທຸກປະເພດດ້ວຍ {productname}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າໂຮສບິວດ໌. ໂຮສບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ OS ແມ່ນໄຄລເອັນ {salt} ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ {sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ) ຫຼື {sles}{nbsp}12 (SP4 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:148
msgid ""
"This procedure guides you through the initial configuration for a build "
"host."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳເຈົ້າກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂຮສບິວດ໌."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:151
msgid ""
"Cross-architecture builds are not possible.  For example, you must build "
"Raspberry PI {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 image on a Raspberry PI (aarch64 "
"architecture) build host running {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3."
msgstr "ການບິວດ໌ຂ້າມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ Raspberry PI {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 ເທິງໂຮສບິວດ໌ Raspberry PI (ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ aarch64) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:152
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure the build host in the {productname} {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ກຳນົດຄ່າໂຮສບິວດ໌ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:153
msgid ""
"Select a client to be designated as a build host from the "
"menu:Systems[Overview] page."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນໂຮສບິວດ໌ຈາກໜ້າເມນູ:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:154
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:System Details[Properties] tab, enable the "
"[guimenu]``Add-on System Type`` [guimenu]``OS Image Build Host``. Confirm "
"with btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ:System Details[Properties], ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ [guimenu]``Add-on System Type`` [guimenu]``OS Image Build Host``. ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:155
#, no-wrap
msgid "os-image-build-host.png"
msgstr "os-image-build-host.png"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:156
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], and enable "
"the required software channels depending on the build host version."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:System Details[Software > Software Channels], ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບເວີຊັນຂອງໂຮສບິວດ໌."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:157
msgid ""
"{sles}{nbsp}12 build hosts require {productname} Client tools "
"(``SLE-Manager-Tools12-Pool`` and ``SLE-Manager-Tools12-Updates``)."
msgstr "ໂຮສບິວດ໌ {sles}{nbsp}12 ຕ້ອງການເຄື່ອງມືໄຄລເອັນ {productname} (``SLE-Manager-Tools12-Pool`` ແລະ ``SLE-Manager-Tools12-Updates``)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:158
msgid ""
"{sles}{nbsp}15 build hosts require {sles} modules "
"``SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Pool`` and "
"``SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Updates``.  Schedule and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:159
msgid ""
"Install Kiwi and all required packages by applying `Highstate`.  From the "
"system details page select menu:States[Highstate] and click btn:[Apply "
"Highstate].  Alternatively, apply Highstate from the {productname} Server "
"command line:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Kiwi ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ `Highstate`. ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບ ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ:States[Highstate] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Highstate]. ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ Highstate ຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}:"

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} web server public certificate RPM"
msgstr "RPM ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະຂອງເວັບເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:162
msgid ""
"Build host provisioning copies the {productname} certificate RPM to the "
"build host.  This certificate is used for accessing repositories provided by "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ການຈັດຕຽມໂຮສບິວດ໌ຈະສຳເນົາ RPM ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ {productname} ໄປຍັງໂຮສບິວດ໌. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບ (repositories) ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:163
msgid ""
"The certificate is packaged in RPM by the "
"`mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage` package script.  The package script is "
"called automatically during a new {productname} installation."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກຈັດເປັນແພັກເກດ RPM ໂດຍສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດ `mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage`. ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດນີ້ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:164
msgid ""
"When you upgrade the `spacewalk-certs-tools` package, the upgrade scenario "
"calls the package script using the default values.  However if the "
"certificate path was changed or unavailable, call the package script "
"manually using `--ca-cert-full-path <path_to_certificate>` after the upgrade "
"procedure has finished."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ `spacewalk-certs-tools`, ຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເກຣດຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ຫາກເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ `--ca-cert-full-path <path_to_certificate>` ຫຼັງຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເກຣດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:165
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package script call example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:166
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/sbin/mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage --ca-cert-full-path "
"/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr "/usr/sbin/mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage --ca-cert-full-path /root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:167
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the certificate is stored in a salt-accessible "
"directory such as:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ salt ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:168
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:169
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the certificate is provided in the local build host "
"repository:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຂອງໂຮສບິວດ໌ພາຍໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "/var/lib/Kiwi/repo\n"
msgstr "/var/lib/Kiwi/repo\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:171
msgid ""
"Specify the RPM package with the {productname} SSL certificate in the build "
"source, and make sure your Kiwi configuration contains "
"``rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage`` as a required package in the "
"``bootstrap`` section."
msgstr "ລະບຸແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຂອງ {productname} ໃນຊອດສ໌ການບິວດ໌, ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການກຳນົດຄ່າ Kiwi ຂອງເຈົ້າປະກອບມີ ``rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage`` ເປັນແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນສ່ວນ ``bootstrap``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:172
#, no-wrap
msgid "config.xml"
msgstr "config.xml"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:173
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"...\n"
"  <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"    ...\n"
"    <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" "
"bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
"  </packages>\n"
"...\n"
msgstr ""
"...\n"
"  <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"    ...\n"
"    <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
"  </packages>\n"
"...\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:174
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key for OS images"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (Activation key) ສຳລັບຮູບພາບ OS"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:175
msgid ""
"Create an activation key associated with the channel that your OS Images can "
"use as repositories when building the image."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຮູບພາບ OS ຂອງເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບໃນເວລາບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:176
msgid "Activation keys are mandatory for OS Image building."
msgstr "ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ OS."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:177
msgid ""
"To build OS Images, you need an activation key that is associated with a "
"channel other than `SUSE Manager Default`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:180
msgid "In the {webui}, select menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:181
msgid "Click [guimenu]``Create Key``."
msgstr "ຄລິກ [guimenu]``Create Key``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:182
msgid ""
"Enter a [guimenu]``Description``, a [guimenu]``Key`` name, and use the "
"drop-down box to select a [guimenu]``Base Channel`` to associate with the "
"key."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Description``, ຊື່ [guimenu]``Key``, ແລະ ໃຊ້ກ່ອງລາຍການເລືອກເພື່ອເລືອກ [guimenu]``Base Channel`` ທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:186
msgid ""
"OS Images can require a significant amount of storage space.  Therefore, we "
"recommended that the OS Image store is located on a partition of its own or "
"on a Btrfs subvolume, separate from the root partition.  By default, the "
"image store is located at [path]``/srv/www/os-images``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:187
msgid ""
"Image stores for Kiwi build type, used to build system, virtual, and other "
"images, are not supported yet."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຮູບພາບສຳລັບປະເພດການບິວດ໌ Kiwi, ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບິວດ໌ລະບົບ, ວຽກສະເໝືອນ (virtual), ແລະ ຮູບພາບອື່ນໆ ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບເທື່ອ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:188
msgid ""
"Images are always stored in [path]``/srv/www/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID`` and "
"are accessible via HTTP/HTTPS "
"[url]**+https://<susemanager_host>/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID+**."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:189
msgid ""
"Images are always stored in [path]``/srv/www/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID`` and "
"are accessible via HTTP/HTTPS "
"[url]**+https://<uyuni_host>/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID+**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:191
msgid "Manage image profiles using the {webui}."
msgstr "ຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:193
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Image Profile"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:194
msgid ""
"To create an image profile select from menu:Images[Profiles] and click "
"btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ໃຫ້ເລືອກຈາກເມນູ:Images[Profiles] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:195
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_image_create_profile_kiwi.png"
msgstr "images_image_create_profile_kiwi.png"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:196
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, provide a name for the `Image Profile`."
msgstr "ໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຊື່ສຳລັບ `Image Profile`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:197
msgid "Use `Kiwi` as the [guimenu]``Image Type``."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `Kiwi` ເປັນ [guimenu]``Image Type``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:198
msgid "Image store is automatically selected."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຮູບພາບຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:199
msgid ""
"Enter a [guimenu]``Config URL`` to the directory containing the Kiwi "
"configuration files:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:200
msgid "git URI"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:201
msgid "HTTPS tarball"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:202
msgid "Path to build host local directory"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:203
msgid ""
"Enter [guimenu]``Kiwi options`` if needed.  If the Kiwi configuration files "
"specify multiple profiles, use [option]``--profile <name>`` to select the "
"active one."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:204
msgid "For other options, see Kiwi documentation."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:205
msgid ""
"Select an [guimenu]``Activation Key``.  Activation keys ensure that images "
"using a profile are assigned to the correct channel and packages."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Activation Key``. ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຮູບພາບທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:206
msgid ""
"Associate an activation key with an image profile to ensure the image "
"profile uses the correct software channel, and any packages."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:207
msgid "Confirm with the btn:[Create] button."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:208
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source format options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຮູບແບບຊອດສ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:209
msgid "_git/HTTP(S) URL to the repository_"
msgstr "_URL git/HTTP(S) ໄປຍັງຄັງເກັບ_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:210
msgid ""
"URL to the git repository containing the sources of the image to be built.  "
"Depending on the layout of the repository the URL can be:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:211
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:212
msgid ""
"You can specify a branch after the `#` character in the URL.  In this "
"example, we use the `master` branch:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸສາຂາ (branch) ຫຼັງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `#` ໃນ URL. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ສາຂາ `master`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:213
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:214
msgid ""
"You can specify a directory that contains the image sources after the `:` "
"character.  In this example, we use `OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6`:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຊອດສ໌ຮູບພາບຫຼັງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `:`.ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ `OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:215
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:216
msgid "_HTTP(S) URL to the tarball_"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:217
msgid "URL to the tar archive, compressed or uncompressed, hosted on the webserver."
msgstr "URL ໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບ tar, ທັງແບບບີບອັດ ຫຼື ບໍ່ບີບອັດ, ທີ່ໂຮສຢູ່ເທິງເວັບເຊີເວີ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:218
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://myimagesourceserver.example.org/MyKiwiImage.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "https://myimagesourceserver.example.org/MyKiwiImage.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:219
msgid "_Path to the directory on the build host_"
msgstr "_ເສັ້ນທາງ (Path) ໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເທິງໂຮສບິວດ໌_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:220
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the directory with the Kiwi build system sources.  This "
"directory must be present on the selected build host."
msgstr "ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີຊອດສ໌ລະບົບການບິວດ໌ Kiwi. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນໂຮສບິວດ໌ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:221
#, no-wrap
msgid "/var/lib/Kiwi/MyKiwiImage\n"
msgstr "/var/lib/Kiwi/MyKiwiImage\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:222
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of Kiwi sources"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຊອດສ໌ Kiwi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:223
msgid ""
"Kiwi sources consist at least of `config.xml`.  Usually, `config.sh` and "
"`images.sh` are present as well.  Sources can also contain files to be "
"installed in the final image under the `root` subdirectory."
msgstr "ຊອດສ໌ Kiwi ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍຕ້ອງປະກອບມີ `config.xml`. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີ `config.sh` ແລະ `images.sh` ຢູ່ຄຳນຳ. ຊອດສ໌ຍັງສາມາດປະກອບມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບພາບຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍພາຍໃຕ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍ `root`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:224
msgid ""
"For information about the Kiwi build system, see the "
"https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[Kiwi documentation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບການບິວດ໌ Kiwi, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[ເອກະສານຂອງ Kiwi]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:225
msgid ""
"{suse} provides examples of fully functional image sources at the "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles[SUSE/manager-build-profiles] "
"public GitHub repository."
msgstr "{suse} ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຊອດສ໌ຮູບພາບທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເຕັມຮູບແບບຢູ່ທີ່ຄັງເກັບ GitHub ສາທາລະນະ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles[SUSE/manager-build-profiles]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:226
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of JeOS config.xml"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ JeOS config.xml"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n"
msgstr "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:228
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<image schemaversion=\"6.1\" name=\"POS_Image_JeOS6\">\n"
"    <description type=\"system\">\n"
"        <author>Admin User</author>\n"
"        <contact>noemail@example.com</contact>\n"
"        <specification>SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP3 JeOS</specification>\n"
"    </description>\n"
"    <preferences>\n"
"        <version>6.0.0</version>\n"
"        <packagemanager>zypper</packagemanager>\n"
"        <bootsplash-theme>SLE</bootsplash-theme>\n"
"        <bootloader-theme>SLE</bootloader-theme>\n"
msgstr ""
"<image schemaversion=\"6.1\" name=\"POS_Image_JeOS6\">\n"
"    <description type=\"system\">\n"
"        <author>Admin User</author>\n"
"        <contact>noemail@example.com</contact>\n"
"        <specification>SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP3 JeOS</specification>\n"
"    </description>\n"
"    <preferences>\n"
"        <version>6.0.0</version>\n"
"        <packagemanager>zypper</packagemanager>\n"
"        <bootsplash-theme>SLE</bootsplash-theme>\n"
"        <bootloader-theme>SLE</bootloader-theme>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:229
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <locale>en_US</locale>\n"
"        <keytable>us.map.gz</keytable>\n"
"        <timezone>Europe/Berlin</timezone>\n"
"        <hwclock>utc</hwclock>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <locale>en_US</locale>\n"
"        <keytable>us.map.gz</keytable>\n"
"        <timezone>Europe/Berlin</timezone>\n"
"        <hwclock>utc</hwclock>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:230
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <rpm-excludedocs>true</rpm-excludedocs>\n"
"        <type boot=\"saltboot/suse-SLES12\" bootloader=\"grub2\" "
"checkprebuilt=\"true\" compressed=\"false\" filesystem=\"ext3\" "
"fsmountoptions=\"acl\" fsnocheck=\"true\" image=\"pxe\" "
"kernelcmdline=\"quiet\"></type>\n"
"    </preferences>\n"
"    <!--    CUSTOM REPOSITORY\n"
"    <repository type=\"rpm-dir\">\n"
"      <source path=\"this://repo\"/>\n"
"    </repository>\n"
"    -->\n"
"    <packages type=\"image\">\n"
"        <package name=\"patterns-sles-Minimal\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"aaa_base-extras\"/> <!-- wouldn't be SUSE without "
"that ;-) -->\n"
"        <package name=\"kernel-default\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"salt-minion\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"        ...\n"
"        <package name=\"sles-release\"/>\n"
"        <!-- this certificate package is required to access {productname} "
"repositories\n"
"             and is provided by {productname} automatically -->\n"
"        <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" "
"bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:231
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"delete\">\n"
"        <package name=\"mtools\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"initviocons\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"</image>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"delete\">\n"
"        <package name=\"mtools\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"initviocons\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"</image>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:233
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build an image using the {webui}.  Either select "
"menu:Images[Build], or click the build icon in the menu:Images[Profiles] "
"list."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:237
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"``latest`` (applies only to containers)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊື່ແທັກ (tag) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເວີຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ``latest`` (ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຄອນເທນເນີເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:238
msgid "Select the [guimenu]``Image Profile`` and a [guimenu]``Build Host``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Image Profile`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Build Host``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:239
msgid ""
"A [guimenu]``Profile Summary`` is displayed to the right of the build "
"fields.  When you have selected a build profile, detailed information about "
"the selected profile is shown here."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Profile Summary`` (ສະຫຼຸບໂປຣໄຟລ໌) ຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຟິວການບິວດ໌. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການບິວດ໌ແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:240
msgid "To schedule a build, click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "ເພື່ອວາງແຜນການບິວດ໌, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:241
msgid ""
"The build server cannot run any form of automounter during the image "
"building process.  If applicable, ensure that you do not have your Gnome "
"session running as root.  If an automounter is running, the image build "
"finishes successfully, but the checksum of the image is different and causes "
"a failure."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີບິວດ໌ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (automounter) ໃດໆ ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ. ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ເຊດຊັນ Gnome ໃນຖານະ root. ຫາກມີ automounter ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບອາດຈະສຳເລັດ, ແຕ່ຄ່າ checksum ຂອງຮູບພາບຈະແຕກຕ່າງ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:242
msgid ""
"After the image is successfully built, the inspection phase begins.  During "
"the inspection phase {susemgr} collects information about the image:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຮູບພາບຖືກບິວດ໌ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ໄລຍະການກວດສອບ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງໄລຍະການກວດສອບ {susemgr} ຈະຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:243
msgid "List of packages installed in the image"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:244
msgid "Checksum of the image"
msgstr "Checksum ຂອງຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:245
msgid "Image type and other image details"
msgstr "ປະເພດຮູບພາບ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດອື່ນໆ ຂອງຮູບພາບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:246
msgid ""
"If the built image type is `PXE`, a {salt} pillar is also generated.  Image "
"pillars are stored in the database and the {salt} subsystem can access "
"details about the generated image.  Details include where the image files "
"are located and provided, image checksums, information needed for network "
"boot, and more."
msgstr "ຫາກປະເພດຮູບພາບທີ່ບິວດ໌ແມ່ນ `PXE`, {salt} pillar ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນນຳ. Image pillars ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລະບົບຍ່ອຍ {salt} ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ລາຍລະອຽດລວມມີສະຖານທີ່ເກັບໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ, ຄ່າ checksum ຂອງຮູບພາບ, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ (network boot), ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:247
msgid "The generated pillar is available to all connected clients."
msgstr "Pillar ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະມີໃຫ້ກັບໄຄລເອັນທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:248
msgid ""
"When building KIWI images with network boot (PXE) enabled (for example, "
"using `installpxe=\"true\"` and `installiso=\"true\"` in the KIWI profile), "
"the netboot artifacts might not be collected and uploaded to the server by "
"default.  To ensure that all bundle artifacts (including `.install.tar` "
"containing the PXE files, and `.raw.xz`) are uploaded to the {productname} "
"server, you must define the `use_bundle_build` custom info key on the build "
"host."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:249
msgid "To configure this:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:250
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[Custom System Info] in the {webui} and create a "
"custom system info key named `use_bundle_build`."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:251
msgid ""
"Assign the `use_bundle_build` key with a value of `true` on the designated "
"OS Image Build Host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:253
msgid ""
"Building an image requires several dependent steps.  When the build fails, "
"investigating {salt} states results and build log can help identify the "
"source of the failure.  You can carry out these checks when the build fails:"
msgstr "ການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບຕ້ອງຜ່ານຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັນ. ເມື່ອການບິວດ໌ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ການກວດສອບຜົນຂອງສະຖານະ {salt} ແລະ ບັນທຶກການບິວດ໌ (build log) ສາມາດຊ່ວຍລະບຸສາເຫດຂອງຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:254
msgid "The build host can access the build sources"
msgstr "ໂຮສບິວດ໌ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊອດສ໌ການບິວດ໌ໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:255
msgid ""
"There is enough disk space for the image on both the build host and the "
"{productname} server"
msgstr "ມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌ພຽງພໍສຳລັບຮູບພາບທັງໃນໂຮສບິວດ໌ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:256
msgid "The activation key has the correct channels associated with it"
msgstr "ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານມີຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມໂຍງຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:257
msgid "The build sources used are valid"
msgstr "ຊອດສ໌ການບິວດ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:258
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the {productname} public certificate is up to date and "
"available at "
"`/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`.  "
"For more on how to refresh a public certificate RPM, see "
"<<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະຂອງ {productname} ແມ່ນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ທີ່ `/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປັບປຸງ RPM ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະ, ເບິ່ງ <<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:259
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ (Limitations)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:260
msgid "The section contains some known issues when working with images."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ປະກອບມີບາງບັນຫາທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນເວລານຳໃຊ້ຮູບພາບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:261
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates used to access the HTTP sources or git repositories "
"should be deployed to the client by a custom state file, or configured "
"manually."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ HTTPS ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຊອດສ໌ HTTP ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບ git ຄວນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໄຄລເອັນໂດຍໄຟລ໌ສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ຫຼື ກຳນົດຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:262
msgid "Importing Kiwi-based images is not supported."
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Kiwi ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:263
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of built images"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທີ່ບິວດ໌ແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:264
msgid ""
"To list available built images select menu:Images[Image List].  A list of "
"all images is displayed."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທີ່ບິວດ໌ແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ:Images[Image List]. ລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:265
#, no-wrap
msgid "images_list_images.png"
msgstr "images_list_images.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:266
msgid ""
"Displayed data about images includes an image [guimenu]``Name``, its "
"[guimenu]``Version``, [guimenu]``Revision``, and the build "
"[guimenu]``Status``.  You can also see the image update status with a "
"listing of possible patch and package updates that are available for the "
"image."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບລວມມີ [guimenu]``Name`` (ຊື່ຮູບພາບ), [guimenu]``Version`` (ເວີຊັນ), [guimenu]``Revision`` (ການແກ້ໄຂ), ແລະ [guimenu]``Status`` (ສະຖານະການບິວດ໌). ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເຫັນສະຖານະການອັບເດດຮູບພາບ ພ້ອມກັບລາຍຊື່ແພັດ (patch) ແລະ ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຮູບພາບນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:267
msgid ""
"For OS Images, the [guimenu]``Name`` and [guimenu]``Version`` fields "
"originate from Kiwi sources and are updated at the end of successful build.  "
"During building or after failed build these fields show a temporary name "
"based on profile name."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຮູບພາບ OS, ຟິວ [guimenu]``Name`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Version`` ແມ່ນມາຈາກຊອດສ໌ Kiwi ແລະ ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອການບິວດ໌ສຳເລັດ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບິວດ໌ ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກການບິວດ໌ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ຟິວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຊື່ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ອີງຕາມຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:268
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Revision`` is automatically increased after each successful "
"build. For OS Images, multiple revisions can co-exist in the store."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Revision`` ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການບິວດ໌ແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງສຳເລັດ. ສຳລັບຮູບພາບ OS, ສາມາດມີຫຼາຍລຸ້ນແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ໃນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:269
msgid ""
"For Container Images the store holds only the latest revision.  Information "
"about previous revisions (packages, patches, etc.) are preserved and it is "
"possible to list them with the [guimenu]``Show obsolete`` checkbox."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຮູບພາບຄອນເທນເນີ, ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈະເກັບສະເພາະລຸ້ນແກ້ໄຂຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລຸ້ນແກ້ໄຂກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ (ແພັກເກດ, ແພັດ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກກ່ອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ [guimenu]``Show obsolete`` (ສະແດງອັນທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:270
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Details] button on an image provides a detailed view.  The "
"detailed view includes an exact list of relevant patches, list of all "
"packages installed within the image and a build log."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Details] ຂອງຮູບພາບຈະສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດ. ມຸມມອງລາຍລະອຽດລວມມີ ລາຍຊື່ແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ, ລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບພາບ ແລະ ບັນທຶກການບິວດ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:271
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Delete] button deletes the image from the list.  It also "
"deletes the associated pillar, files from OS Image Store and obsolete "
"revisions."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete] ຈະລຶບຮູບພາບອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່. ມັນຍັງຈະລຶບ pillar ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ໄຟລ໌ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຮູບພາບ OS ແລະ ລຸ້ນແກ້ໄຂທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:272
msgid ""
"The patch and the package list is only available if the inspect state after "
"a build was successful."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດຈະມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອສະຖານະການກວດສອບຫຼັງຈາກການບິວດ໌ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Infrastructure Maintenance Tasks"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you work with scheduled downtime periods, you might find it difficult to "
"remember all the things that you need to do before, during, and after that "
"critical downtime of the {productname} Server.  {productname} Server related "
"systems such as Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers or {productname} "
"Proxies are also affected and have to be considered."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າເຮັດວຽກກັບໄລຍະເວລາຢຸດພັກລະບົບ (downtime) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຈື່ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດກ່ອນ, ໃນລະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກການຢຸດພັກລະບົບທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້ຍາກ. ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ ເຊີເວີລູກ (Slave Servers) ຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ {productname} ກໍໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການພິຈາລະນານຳ."

#.  It's similar to zypper at the package level:
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{suse} recommends you always keep your {productname} infrastructure "
"updated.  That includes servers, proxies, and build hosts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you do not keep the {productname} Server updated, you might not be able "
"to update some parts of your environment when you need to."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section contains a checklist for your downtime period, with links to "
"further information on performing each of the steps."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ປະກອບມີລາຍການກວດສອບ (checklist) ສຳລັບໄລຍະເວລາຢຸດພັກລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ, ພ້ອມກັບລິ້ງໄປຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການປະຕິບັດແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ"

#.  ke, 2019-09-30: we'll stop spacewalk during the update
#.  . Stop spacewalk services.
#.  You need to stop the spacewalk, SAP, and database services, along with any others you have running.
#.  . Check if the configuration is still correct.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:7
msgid "Apply the latest updates."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:8
msgid "See xref:installation-and-upgrade:server-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#.  We reboot during the above listed procedures.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:9
msgid "Upgrade to the latest service pack, if required."
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດເປັນເຊີວິດແພັກ (service pack) ຫຼ້າສຸດ, ຫາກຈຳເປັນ."

#.  . Reboot the server.
#.  . Check if the configuration is still correct.
#.  . Start any stopped services.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Run [command]``spacewalk-service status`` and check whether all required "
"services are up and running."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For information about database schema upgrades and PostgreSQL migrations, "
"see xref:installation-and-upgrade:db-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:12
msgid "You can install updates using your package manager."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For information on using {yast}, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For information on using zypper, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."
msgstr ""

#
#
#. Preferable, you run such a tool within a maintenance window; for more information, see xref:administration:maintenance-window.adoc#maintenance-window[].
#. complete procedure, also see above:
#. 1. Log in as root user to the SUSE Manager server.
#. 2. Stop the Spacewalk service:
#.    spacewalk-service stop
#. 3. Apply the patch using either zypper patch or YaST Online Update.
#. 4. Upgrade the database schema:
#.     spacewalk-schema-upgrade
#. 5. Start the Spacewalk service:
#.     spacewalk-service start
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:15
msgid ""
"By default, several update channels are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບເຊີເວີ {productname}. ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To keep {susemgr} up to date, either connect it directly to {scc} or use "
"{rmtool} (RMT).  You can use RMT as a local installation source for "
"disconnected environments."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:17
msgid ""
"You can check that the update channels are available on your system with "
"this command:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າຫຼືບໍ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper lr\n"
msgstr "zypper lr\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:19
msgid "The output looks similar to this:"
msgstr "ຜົນທີ່ສະແດງຈະມີລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name                                                   | Enabled | GPG Check "
"| Refresh\n"
"-------------------------------------------------------+---------+-----------+--------\n"
"SLE-Module-Basesystem15-SP2-Pool                       | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Basesystem15-SP2-Updates                    | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Python2-15-SP2-Pool                         | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-Python2-15-SP2-Updates                      | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Server-4.1-Pool               | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Server-4.1-Updates            | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-SUSE-Manager-Server-4.1-Pool                | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| No\n"
"SLE-Module-SUSE-Manager-Server-4.1-Updates             | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
"| Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-SP2-Pool              | Yes     | (r ) Yes  "
