#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring Managed Systems"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (Monitoring Managed Systems)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:136
msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics exporters can be installed and configured on Salt clients "
"using formulas.  The packages are available from the {productname} client "
"tools channels, and can be enabled and configured directly in the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Prometheus metrics exporters ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ໂດຍໃຊ້ formulas ໄດ້. ແພັກເກັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ client tools ຂອງ {productname}, ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ພ້ອມທັງຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:137
msgid "These exporters can be installed on managed systems:"
msgstr "exporters ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:144
msgid ""
"On {sle-micro}, only the Node exporter and the Blackbox exporter are "
"available."
msgstr "ໃນ {sle-micro}, ມີພຽງແຕ່ Node exporter ແລະ Blackbox exporter ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:145
msgid ""
"When you have the exporters installed and configured, you can start using "
"Prometheus to collect metrics from monitored systems.  If you have "
"configured your monitoring server with the {webui}, metrics collection "
"happens automatically."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Prometheus Exporters on a Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Prometheus Exporters ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:147
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the client to be "
"monitored, and navigate to the menu:Formulas tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:148
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Enabled`` checkbox on the ``Prometheus Exporters`` "
"formula."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Enabled`` ໃນ formula ``Prometheus Exporters``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:150
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:151
msgid ""
"Select the exporters you want to enable and customize arguments according to "
"your needs."
msgstr "ເລືອກ exporters ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງ arguments ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:152
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Address`` field accepts either a port number preceded by a "
"colon (``:9100``), or a fully resolvable address (``example:9100``)."
msgstr "ຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Address`` ສາມາດໃສ່ເປັນເລກພອດທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳສອງເມັດນຳໜ້າ (``:9100``) ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ສາມາດລະບຸຕົວຕົນໄດ້ເຕັມຮູບແບບ (``example:9100``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:154
msgid "Apply the highstate."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ (Apply) highstate."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:155
#, no-wrap
msgid "monitoring_configure_formula.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:156
msgid ""
"Monitoring formulas can also be configured for System Groups, by applying "
"the same configuration used for individual systems inside the corresponding "
"group."
msgstr "Monitoring formulas ຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ (System Groups) ໄດ້ ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບພາຍໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:158
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Grafana Password"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:159
msgid ""
"To change the Grafana password follow the steps described in the Grafana "
"documentation:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ Grafana ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານຂອງ Grafana:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:160
msgid "https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/user-management/user-preferences/#change-your-grafana-password"
msgstr "https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/user-management/user-preferences/#change-your-grafana-password"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:161
msgid ""
"In case you have lost the Grafana administrator password you can reset it as "
"[literal]``root`` with the following command:"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານລືມລະຫັດຜ່ານ administrator ຂອງ Grafana, ທ່ານສາມາດ reset ມັນໄດ້ໃນນາມ [literal]``root`` ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grafana-cli --configOverrides cfg:default.paths.data=/var/lib/grafana "
"--homepath /usr/share/grafana admin reset-admin-password <new_password>\n"
msgstr "grafana-cli --configOverrides cfg:default.paths.data=/var/lib/grafana --homepath /usr/share/grafana admin reset-admin-password <new_password>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:163
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Boundaries"
msgstr "ຂອບເຂດເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:164
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to monitored clients.  By default, "
"Prometheus uses these ports:"
msgstr "Prometheus ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຊີ້ວັດ (metrics) ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກການດຶງ (pull mechanism), ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຊີເວີຕ້ອງສາມາດສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຫາໄຄເອັນ (clients) ທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມໄດ້. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Prometheus ຈະໃຊ້ພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:165
msgid "Node exporter: 9100"
msgstr "Node exporter: 9100"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:166
msgid "PostgreSQL exporter: 9187"
msgstr "PostgreSQL exporter: 9187"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:167
msgid "Apache exporter: 9117"
msgstr "Apache exporter: 9117"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:168
msgid ""
"Additionally, if you are running the alert manager on a different host than "
"where you run Prometheus, you also need to open port 9093."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:169
msgid ""
"For clients installed on cloud instances, you can add the required ports to "
"a security group that has access to the monitoring server."
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ເທິງຄລາວ (cloud instances), ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພອດທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ (security group) ທີ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີການຕິດຕາມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:170
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can deploy a Prometheus instance in the exporters' local "
"network, and configure federation.  This allows the main monitoring server "
"to scrape the time series from the local Prometheus instance.  If you use "
"this method, you only need to open the Prometheus API port, which is 9090."
msgstr "ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus instance ໄວ້ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງຕົວສົ່ງອອກ (exporters' local network) ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຫະພັນ (federation). ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຊີເວີການຕິດຕາມຫຼັກສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (scrape) time series ຈາກ Prometheus instance ທີ່ຢູ່ທ້ອງຖິ່ນໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້, ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ Prometheus API ຄື 9090."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:171
msgid ""
"For more information on Prometheus federation, see "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/federation/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Prometheus federation, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/federation/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:172
msgid ""
"You can also proxy requests through the network boundary.  Tools like "
"PushProx deploy a proxy and a client on both sides of the network barrier "
"and allow Prometheus to work across network topologies such as NAT."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດພຣັອກຊີ (proxy) ຄຳຮ້ອງຜ່ານຂອບເຂດເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້. ເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ PushProx ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ ໄຄເອັນໄວ້ທັງສອງດ້ານຂອງສິ່ງກີດຂວາງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Prometheus ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຜ່ານຮູບແບບເຄືອຂ່າຍຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ NAT ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:173
msgid ""
"For more information on PushProx, see "
"https://github.com/RobustPerception/PushProx."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ PushProx, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/RobustPerception/PushProx."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:174
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reverse Proxy Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Reverse Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:175
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to each exporter on the monitored "
"clients.  To simplify your firewall configuration, you can use reverse proxy "
"for your exporters to expose all metrics on a single port."
msgstr "Prometheus ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຊີ້ວັດໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກການດຶງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຊີເວີຕ້ອງສາມາດສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຫາແຕ່ລະ exporter ຢູ່ເທິງໄຄເອັນທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ. ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍ (firewall) ຂອງທ່ານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ reverse proxy ສໍາລັບ exporter ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອລວມຕົວຊີ້ວັດທັງໝົດອອກມາຜ່ານພອດດຽວ."

#.  Probably a diagram here. --LKB 2020-08-11
#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:176
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Prometheus Exporters with Reverse Proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus Exporters ດ້ວຍ Reverse Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:177
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system to be "
"monitored, and navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕາມ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:178
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Prometheus Exporters`` checkbox to enable the exporters "
"formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເອົາຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Prometheus Exporters`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ exporters formula, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:179
msgid "Navigate to the ``Prometheus Exporters`` tab in the top menu."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ ``Prometheus Exporters`` ໃນເມນູດ້ານເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:180
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Enable reverse proxy`` option, and enter a valid "
"reverse proxy port number."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເອົາຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``Enable reverse proxy``, ແລ້ວປ້ອນໝາຍເລກພອດ reverse proxy ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:181
msgid "For example, ``9999``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ``9999``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:182
msgid "Customize the other exporters according to your needs."
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງ exporters ອື່ນໆ ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:187
msgid ""
"Prometheus server and Prometheus node exporter offer a built-in mechanism to "
"secure their endpoints with TLS encryption and authentication.  "
"{productname} {webui} simplifies the configuration of all involved "
"components. The TLS certificates have to be provided and deployed by the "
"user.  {productname} offers enabling the following security model:"
msgstr "Prometheus server ແລະ Prometheus node exporter ມີກົນໄກໃນຕົວເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພໃຫ້ກັບ endpoints ດ້ວຍການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. {productname} {webui} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນປະກອບທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນັ້ນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS (TLS certificates) ຕ້ອງຖືກຈັດຕຽມ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້. {productname} ຮອງຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຄວາມປອດໄພດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:188
msgid "Node exporter: TLS encryption and client certificate based authentication"
msgstr "Node exporter: ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໂດຍໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:189
msgid "Prometheus: TLS encryption and basic authentication"
msgstr "Prometheus: ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ TLS ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບພື້ນຖານ (basic authentication)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:190
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring all available options, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generating TLS certificates"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:192
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} does not provide any certificates for securing "
"monitoring configuration.  For providing security, you can generate or "
"import custom certificates, self-signed or signed by a third party "
"certificate authority (CA)."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃດໆ ສຳລັບການຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕິດຕາມ. ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເອງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແບບລົງນາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (self-signed) ຫຼື ລົງນາມໂດຍຜູ້ອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA) ພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:193
msgid ""
"This section demonstrates how to generate client/server certificates for "
"Prometheus and Node exporter minions self-signed with SUSE Manager CA."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:194
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating server/client TLS certificate"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ແບບ server/client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:195
msgid "On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, run following command:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ໃນໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:196
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"minion.example.com\" --set-cname=\"minion.example.com\" "
"--no-rpm\n"
msgstr ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"minion.example.com\" --set-cname=\"minion.example.com\" --no-rpm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:197
msgid ""
"Ensure that the [systemitem]``set-cname`` parameter is the fully qualified "
"domain name (FQDN) of your Salt client.  You can use the the "
"[systemitem]``set-cname`` parameter multiple times if you require multiple "
"aliases."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:198
msgid ""
"Copy ``server.crt`` and ``server.key`` files to the Salt minion and provide "
"read access for ``prometheus`` user."
msgstr "ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ ``server.crt`` ແລະ ``server.key`` ໄປຍັງ Salt minion ແລະ ກຳນົດສິດການອ່ານໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``prometheus``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Security with OpenSCAP"
msgstr "ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບດ້ວຍ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses OpenSCAP to audit clients.  It allows you to schedule and "
"view compliance scans for any client."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອກວດສອບ (audit) ໄຄເອັນ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະ ເບິ່ງຜົນການສະແກນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງ (compliance scans) ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນໃດໆ ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "About SCAP"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) is a synthesis of "
"interoperable specifications derived from community ideas.  It is a line of "
"specifications maintained by the National Institute of Standards and "
"Technology (NIST) for maintaining system security for enterprise systems."
msgstr "Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) ແມ່ນການລວມເອົາຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານເຕັກນິກທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງມາຈາກແນວຄວາມຄິດຂອງຊຸມຊົນ. ມັນແມ່ນຊຸດຂອງຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ຖືກດູແລໂດຍສະຖາບັນມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີແຫ່ງຊາດ (NIST) ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບລະບົບໃນລະດັບອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:5
msgid ""
"SCAP was created to provide a standardized approach to maintaining system "
"security, and the standards that are used continually change to meet the "
"needs of the community and enterprise businesses.  New specifications are "
"governed by NIST's SCAP Release cycle to provide a consistent and repeatable "
"revision work flow.  For more information, see:"
msgstr "SCAP ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເປັນແນວທາງມາດຕະຖານໃນການຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບ, ແລະ ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ນັ້ນກໍມີການປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕອບໂຈດຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງຊຸມຊົນ ແລະ ພາກທຸລະກິດ. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃໝ່ໆ ຈະຖືກກຳກັບໂດຍຮອບວຽນການປ່ອຍ SCAP ຂອງ NIST ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບປຸງທີ່ຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ເຮັດຊ້ຳໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:6
msgid "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/security-content-automation-protocol"
msgstr "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/security-content-automation-protocol"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:7
msgid "https://www.open-scap.org/features/standards/"
msgstr "https://www.open-scap.org/features/standards/"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:8
msgid "https://ncp.nist.gov/repository?scap"
msgstr "https://ncp.nist.gov/repository?scap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} uses OpenSCAP to implement the SCAP specifications.  OpenSCAP "
"is an auditing tool that utilizes the Extensible Configuration Checklist "
"Description Format (XCCDF).  XCCDF is a standard way of expressing checklist "
"content and defines security checklists.  It also combines with other "
"specifications such as Common Platform Enumeration (CPE), Common "
"Configuration Enumeration (CCE), and Open Vulnerability and Assessment "
"Language (OVAL), to create a SCAP-expressed checklist that can be processed "
"by SCAP-validated products."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ SCAP. OpenSCAP ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືກວດສອບທີ່ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ Extensible Configuration Checklist Description Format (XCCDF). XCCDF ແມ່ນວິທີມາດຕະຖານໃນການສະແດງເນື້ອຫາລາຍການກວດສອບ (checklist) ແລະ ກຳນົດລາຍການກວດສອບຄວາມປອດໄພ. ມັນຍັງລວມເຂົ້າກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ Common Platform Enumeration (CPE), Common Configuration Enumeration (CCE), ແລະ Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language (OVAL) ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍການກວດສອບໃນຮູບແບບ SCAP ທີ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໂດຍຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP verifies the presence of patches by using content produced by the "
"{suse} Security Team.  OpenSCAP checks system security configuration "
"settings and examines systems for signs of compromise by using rules based "
"on standards and specifications.  For more information about the {suse} "
"Security Team, see https://www.suse.com/support/security."
msgstr "OpenSCAP ຈະກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຂອງແພັດຊ໌ (patches) ໂດຍໃຊ້ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍທີມງານຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ {suse}. OpenSCAP ຈະກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ກວດເບິ່ງລະບົບເພື່ອຫາຮ່ອງຮອຍການຖືກບຸກລຸກໂດຍໃຊ້ກົດເກນທີ່ອີງຕາມມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດດ້ານເຕັກນິກ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບທີມງານຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ {suse}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.suse.com/support/security."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Clients for an SCAP Scan"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:12
msgid "Before you begin, you need to prepare your client systems for SCAP scanning."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຽມລະບົບໄຄເອັນຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບການສະແກນ SCAP."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:13
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP auditing is not available on Salt clients that use the SSH contact "
"method."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບດ້ວຍ OpenSCAP ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ Salt clients ທີ່ໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Scanning clients can consume a lot of memory and compute power on the client "
"being scanned.  For {redhat} clients, ensure you have at least 2{nbsp}GB of "
"RAM available on each client to be scanned."
msgstr "ການສະແກນໄຄເອັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ກຳລັງການປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກສະແກນ. ສຳລັບໄຄເອັນ {redhat}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ RAM ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2{nbsp}GB ຫວ່າງຢູ່ໃນແຕ່ລະໄຄເອັນທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແກນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For traditional and Salt clients, install the OpenSCAP scanner and the SCAP "
"Security Guide (content) packages before you begin.  Depending on the "
"operating system, these packages are included either on the base operating "
"system, or in the {productname} Client Tools."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The table below lists the packages you need depending on your client "
"operating system:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ OpenSCAP"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operating system | Scanner | Content\n"
"| SLES | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide\n"
"| openSUSE | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide\n"
"| RHEL | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| CentOS | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| Oracle Linux | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| Ubuntu | libopenscap8 | scap-security-guide-ubuntu\n"
"| Debian | libopenscap8 | scap-security-guide-debian\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ | Scanner | Content\n"
"| SLES | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide\n"
"| openSUSE | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide\n"
"| RHEL | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| CentOS | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| Oracle Linux | openscap-utils | scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| Ubuntu | libopenscap8 | scap-security-guide-ubuntu\n"
"| Debian | libopenscap8 | scap-security-guide-debian\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:19
msgid ""
"RHEL 7 and compatible systems provide a [package]``scap-security-guide`` "
"package, which contains outdated contents.  You are advised to use the "
"[package]``scap-security-guide-redhat`` package you will find in the "
"{productname} Client Tools."
msgstr "RHEL 7 ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຈະມີແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ເຊິ່ງມີເນື້ອຫາທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ. ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide-redhat`` ທີ່ທ່ານຈະພົບໃນ {productname} Client Tools."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:20
msgid ""
"{suse} provides the [package]``scap-security-guide`` package for different "
"openscap profiles.  In the current version of "
"[package]``scap-security-guide``, {suse} supports the following profiles:"
msgstr "{suse} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ OpenSCAP ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໃນເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ [package]``scap-security-guide``, {suse} ຮອງຮັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:21
