"| Custom Info | [command]``custom-info`` | Client custom information. | Yes "
"|\n"
"| Patches in Channels | [command]``errata-channels`` | All patches in "
"channels. | Yes |\n"
"| Patches Details | [command]``errata-list`` | All patches that affect "
"registered clients. | Yes |\n"
"| All patches | [command]``errata-list-all`` | All patches. | No |\n"
"| Patches for Clients | [command]``errata-systems`` | Applicable patches and "
"any registered clients that are affected. | Yes |\n"
"| Host Guests | [command]``host-guests`` | Host and guests mapping. | Yes "
"|\n"
"| Inactive Clients | [command]``inactive-systems`` | Inactive clients. | Yes "
"| The mandatory parameter is now called ``threshold``.\n"
"| System Inventory | [command]``inventory`` | Clients registered to the "
"server, together with hardware and software information. | Yes | The column "
"``osad_status`` has been removed.\n"
"| Kickstart Scripts | [command]``kickstart-scripts`` | All kickstart "
"scripts, with details. | No |\n"
"| Kickstart Trees | [command]``kickstartable-trees`` | Kickstartable "
"trees. | No |\"\n"
"| All Upgradable Versions | [command]``packages-updates-all`` | All newer "
"package versions that can be upgraded. | Yes |\n"
"| Newest Upgradable Version | [command]``packages-updates-newest`` | Newest "
"package versions that can be upgraded. | Yes |\n"
"| Proxy Overview | [command]``proxies-overview`` | All proxies and the "
