msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc:5
msgid "Remove the following package:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-register-trad-as-salt-after-deletion.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypp-plugin-spacewalk\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Cloned Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using {productname} to manage virtual machines, you might find it "
"useful to create clones of your VMs.  A clone is a VM that uses a primary "
"disk that is an exact copy of an existing disk."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຈັດການເວີຊົວແມຊີນ (VMs), ເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຫັນວ່າມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງໂຄລນຂອງ VM. ໂຄລນແມ່ນ VM ທີ່ໃຊ້ດິສຫຼັກທີ່ເປັນການສຳເນົາທີ່ຄືກັນທຸກຢ່າງຂອງດິສທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While cloning VMs can save you a lot of time, the duplicated identifying "
"information on the disk can sometimes cause problems."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າການໂຄລນ VM ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນການລະບຸຕົວຕົນທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນຢູ່ໃນດິສບາງຄັ້ງອາດສ້າງບັນຫາໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you have a client that is already registered, you create a clone of that "
"client, and then try and register the clone, you probably want {productname} "
"to register them as two separate clients.  However, if the machine ID in "
"both the original client and the clone is the same, {productname} registers "
"both clients as one system, and the existing client data is overwritten with "
"that of the clone."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ແລະທ່ານສ້າງຕົວໂຄນຂອງເຄື່ອງນັ້ນ, ຈາກນັ້ນພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນຕົວໂຄນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນສອງເຄື່ອງແຍກກັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າ machine ID ໃນທັງເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຕົວໂຄນຄືກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງເຄື່ອງເປັນລະບົບດຽວກັນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຕົວໂຄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ machine ID ຂອງຕົວໂຄນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າພວກມັນເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each step of this procedure is performed on the cloned client.  This "
"procedure does not manipulate the original client, which remains registered "
"to {productname}."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນເຮັດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ. ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄປປ່ຽນແປງເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງຍັງຄົງລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ Machine ID ທີ່ຊໍ້າກັນໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:8
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:27
msgid "On the cloned machine, change the hostname and IP addresses."
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ hostname ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:9
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Make sure [path]``/etc/hosts`` contains the changes you made and the correct "
"host entries."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [path]``/etc/hosts`` ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ມູນ host ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For distributions that support systemd: If your machines have the same "
"machine ID, as root, delete the files on each duplicated client and "
"re-create it:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If the cloned machine also has a folder in [path]``/var/log/journal/`` it "
"needs to be renamed accordingly to the new machine ID.  If names do not "
"match, [command]``journalctl`` could not retrieve any log and "
"[command]``podman logs`` would not show anything."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"
msgstr "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For distributions that do not support systemd: As root, generate a machine "
"ID from dbus:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If your clients still have the same Salt client ID, delete the "
"[path]``minion_id`` file on each client (FQDN is used when it is regenerated "
"on client restart).  For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:18
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:22
msgid "For Salt Bundle clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Bundle:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Delete accepted keys from the onboarding page and the system profile from "
"{productname}, and restart the client with.  For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "service salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:24
msgid "Re-register the clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Each client now has a different [path]``/etc/machine-id`` and should be "
"correctly displayed on the [guimenu]``System Overview`` page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Traditional Clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Stop the [systemitem]``rhnsd`` daemon, on {rhnminrelease6} and {sle} 11 "
"with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/init.d/rhnsd stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:31
msgid "or, on newer systemd-based systems, with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "service rhnsd stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:33
msgid "Stop [systemitem]``osad`` with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/init.d/osad stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:35
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:37
msgid "or:"
msgstr "ຫຼື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "service osad stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "rcosad stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Remove the [systemitem]``osad`` authentication configuration file and the "
"system ID:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -f /etc/sysconfig/rhn/{osad-auth.conf,systemid}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:41
msgid "Delete the files containing the machine IDs:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:42
msgid "SLES{nbsp}12:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:44
msgid "SLES{nbsp}11:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "suse_register -E\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:46
msgid "Remove the credential files:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:47
msgid "SLES clients:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -f /etc/zypp/credentials.d/{SCCcredentials,NCCcredentials}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:49
msgid "{rhel} clients:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm  -f /etc/NCCcredentials\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:51
msgid "Re-run the bootstrap script."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:52
msgid ""
"You should now see the cloned system in {productname} without overriding the "
"system it was cloned from."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Traditional Red Hat Clients"
msgstr ""

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Traditional RHEL 7 and SLES-ES 7 clients require some unsigned packages in order to work properly with {productname}, so custom channels for these client types usually unset the gpgcheck flag.
#. However, the rhnplugin.conf file overrides this setting, and enables the GPG check.
#. Consequence: When traditional RHEL 7 or SLES-ES 7 clients are registered, the client will not install unsigned packages from the custom channel, even if the gpgcheck is disabled in the custom channel.
#. Fix: Edit the /etc/yum/pluginconf.d/rhnplugin.conf file to disable the GPG check.
#. Result: Unsigned packages can be installed as required, and the clients will work as expected.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Traditional {rhel}{nbsp}7 and SLES {es}{nbsp}7 clients require some unsigned "
"packages to work properly with {productname}, so custom channels for these "
"client types usually unset the ``gpgcheck`` flag.  However, the "
"``rhnplugin.conf`` file overrides this setting, and enables the GPG check."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This means that when traditional {rhel}{nbsp}7 and SLES {es}{nbsp}7 clients "
"are registered, the client will not install unsigned packages from the "
"custom channel, even if the ``gpgcheck`` is disabled in the custom channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registertradrhel.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resolve the problem, edit the ``/etc/yum/pluginconf.d/rhnplugin.conf`` "
"file and disable the GPG check to enable installation of unsigned packages, "
"and allow the clients to work as expected."
msgstr ""

