msgid "Setting up SUSE Manager with separate disk for data in Public Cloud (BYOS)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Issue:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} setup results with an error while restarting services during "
"setup."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:4
msgid "The setup fails on restarting Tomcat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "error-1.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Reason:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When {productname} is set up using separate disks for cache, pgsql and "
"spacewalk, the existing data within these partitions are covered under the "
"new mount point."
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "partitions.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Because of this, data for certain services like tomcat go missing due to a "
"broken symbolic link."
msgstr "ຍ້ອນເຫດນີ້, ຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບບາງບໍລິການ ເຊັ່ນ tomcat ຈຶ່ງຫາຍໄປເນື່ອງຈາກ Symbolic link ເພ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "broken-symlink.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:11
msgid ""
"As {productname} instance of cloud already has some services set up, when "
"the data is not available during set up it causes the service to not restart "
"as expected.  Therefore the setup fails."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ເທິງຄລາວມີບາງບໍລິການທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການບໍ່ສາມາດ Restart ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຶ່ງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "incomplete-files.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:13
msgid "Actual data which should be present:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງທີ່ຄວນຈະມີຢູ່:"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "actual-files.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "**How to Recreate:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} Server provisioned in {aws} uses relevant AMI for {byos}"
msgstr "{productname} Server ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໃນ {aws} ໂດຍໃຊ້ AMI ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສຳລັບ {byos}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:17
msgid "Separate storage for spacewalk, {postgresql} and cache."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:18
msgid "The size of the partition depends on the repository to be synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:19
msgid "Set up {productname} using [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resolution:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To resolve or avoid the issue, copy the data of the underlying partition "
"into the new partition by following the steps below:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ Partition ເດີມລົງໃນ Partition ໃໝ່ ໂດຍປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:22
msgid "Create a backup partition"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Partition ສຳຮອງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir /bkp\n"
msgstr "mkdir /bkp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:24
msgid "Unmount the affected partition for example /var/cache."
msgstr "Unmount Partition ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ຕົວຢ່າງ /var/cache."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "umount /var/cache\n"
msgstr "umount /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Check the underlying data in the partition.  This should list the actual "
"data present in the directory."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານໃນ Partition. ອັນນີ້ຄວນຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ Directory."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:28
msgid "Copy the data onto the backup partition created in step 1."
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນ Partition ສຳຮອງທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:30
msgid "Mount the partition again using option 1 or 2:"
msgstr "Mount Partition ອີກຄັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກ 1 ຫຼື 2:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(option 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(option 2)   mount -a (if you have the entries under /etc/fstab)\n"
msgstr ""
"(ທາງເລືອກ 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(ທາງເລືອກ 2)   mount -a (ຫາກທ່ານມີລາຍການຢູ່ໃນ /etc/fstab)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:32
msgid "Copy the backed up data from step 4 to the mounted partition"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 4 ລົງໃນ Partition ທີ່ Mount ແລ້ວ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:34
msgid "Verify the data is present"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຂໍ້ມູນມີຢູ່ຈິງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:36
msgid "Repeat the {productname} setup"
msgstr "ເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"
msgstr "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Conclusion**:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-suma-installation-public-cloud.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When using {productname} in public cloud with separate data partitions, make "
"sure that the existing data in those directories are copied onto the new "
"partition."
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ Public Cloud ທີ່ມີການແຍກ Partition ຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນ Directory ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກກັອບປີ້ລົງໃນ Partition ໃໝ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນ (Synchronization)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Synchronization can fail for a number of reasons.  To get more information "
"about a connection problem, run this command:"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນສາມາດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້ຍ້ອນຫຼາຍສາເຫດ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > "
"/var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"
msgstr ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > /var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:4
msgid "You can also check logs created by Zypper at [path]``/var/log/zypper.log``"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບບັນທຶກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ Zypper ໄດ້ທີ່ [path]``/var/log/zypper.log``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Mismatch"
msgstr "GPG Key ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} does not automatically trust third party GPG keys.  If package "
"synchronization fails, it could be because of an untrusted GPG key.  You can "
"find out if this is the case by opening [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` and "
"looking for an error like this:"
msgstr "{productname} ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັກເກດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ມັນອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນ GPG key ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກເຊື່ອຖື. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not "
"imported\n"
msgstr ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To resolve the problem, you need to import the GPG key to {productname}.  "
"For more on importing GPG keys, see "
"xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ໄປຍັງ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າ GPG keys, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Removal from [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``"
msgstr "ການລຶບ GPG Key ອອກຈາກ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When a GPG key for repository has been manually imported using "
"[literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``, and this key is no longer needed (for "
"example if the the key was compromised, or was used for testing purposes "
"only), it can be removed from the zypper RPM database used by "
"[literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` with the following command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"
msgstr "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:12
msgid "where [literal]``gpg-pubkey-*`` is the name of the GPG key to be removed."
msgstr "ໂດຍທີ່ [literal]``gpg-pubkey-*`` ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງ GPG key ທີ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renewing GPG Key"
msgstr "ການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If you want to renew a GPG key, first remove the old key, and then generate "
"and import a new one."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG key, ໃຫ້ລຶບຄີເກົ່າອອກກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນສ້າງ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຄີໃໝ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checksum Mismatch"
msgstr "Checksum ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If a checksum has failed, you might see an error like this in the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log`` log file:"
msgstr "ຖ້າ Checksum ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"
msgstr ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by running the synchronization from the command "
"prompt with the [command]``-Y`` option:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [command]``-Y``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This option verifies the repository data before the synchronization, rather "
"than relying on locally cached checksums."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວກ່ອນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ແທນທີ່ຈະໄປອາໄສ checksums ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ cache ຂອງເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Timeout"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໝົດເວລາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:22
msgid "If the download times out with the following error:"
msgstr "ຖ້າການດາວໂຫລດໝົດເວລາດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 seconds\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by specifying [literal]``reposync_timeout`` and "
"[literal]``reposync_minrate`` configuration values in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``.  By default, when less than 1000 bytes per "
"second are transferred in 300 secs, the download is aborted.  You can adjust "
"the number of bytes per second with [literal]``reposync_minrate``, and the "
"number of seconds to wait with [literal]``reposync_timeout``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລະບຸຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``reposync_timeout`` ແລະ [literal]``reposync_minrate`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ເມື່ອມີການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 1000 ໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ວິນາທີໃນເວລາ 300 ວິນາທີ, ການດາວໂຫລດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ວິນາທີໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [literal]``reposync_minrate``, ແລະ ປັບຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [literal]``reposync_timeout``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually Trusting the Key During reposync"
msgstr "ການຍອມຮັບຄີ (Key) ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການ reposync"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:26
msgid ""
"It is possible that in some cases when [command]``reposync`` is run, you may "
"need to accept the GPG key manually.  For example:"
msgstr "ເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າໃນບາງກໍລະນີເມື່ອລັນ [command]``reposync``, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຍອມຮັບ GPG key ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 | Channel: nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 Sync of channel started.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "New repository or package signing key received:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Repository:       nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"  Key Fingerprint:  610C 7B14 E068 A878 070D A4E9 9CD0 A493 D42D 0685\n"
"  Key Name:         cudatools <cudatools@nvidia.com>\n"
"  Key Algorithm:    RSA 4096\n"
"  Key Created:      Thu Apr 14 16:04:01 2022\n"
"  Key Expires:      (does not expire)\n"
"  Rpm Name:         gpg-pubkey-d42d0685-62589a51\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Note: Signing data enables the recipient to verify that no modifications "
"occurred after the data\n"
"    were signed. Accepting data with no, wrong or unknown signature can lead "
"to a corrupted system\n"
"    and in extreme cases even to a system compromise.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Note: A GPG pubkey is clearly identified by its fingerprint. Do not rely "
"on the key's name. If\n"
"    you are not sure whether the presented key is authentic, ask the "
"repository provider or check\n"
"    their web site. Many providers maintain a web page showing the "
"fingerprints of the GPG keys they\n"
"    are using.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Do you want to reject the key, trust temporarily, or trust always? [r/t/a/?] "
"(r):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Taskomatic"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Taskomatic"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Repository metadata regeneration is a relatively intensive process, so "
"Taskomatic can take several minutes to complete.  Additionally, if "
"Taskomatic crashes, repository metadata regeneration can be interrupted."
msgstr "ການສ້າງ metadata ຂອງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຄືກັນໃໝ່ເປັນຂະບວນການທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Taskomatic ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍນາທີເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຖ້າ Taskomatic ຫຼົ້ມ, ການສ້າງ metadata ຄືນໃໝ່ກໍອາດຈະຖືກຂັດຈັງຫວະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If Taskomatic is still running, or if the process has crashed, package "
"updates can seem available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the client, "
"and attempts to update the client fail.  In this case, the [command]``zypper "
"ref`` command shows an error like this:"
msgstr "ຖ້າ Taskomatic ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ຫຼື ຖ້າຂະບວນການຫຼົ້ມ, ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດອາດຈະເຫັນວ່າມີໃຫ້ໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper ref`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
msgstr "Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To correct this, determine if Taskomatic is still in the process of "
"generating repository metadata, or if a crash could have occurred.  Wait for "
"metadata regeneration to complete or restart Taskomatic after a crash in "
"order for client updates to be carried out correctly."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າ Taskomatic ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂະບວນການສ້າງ metadata ຫຼື ບໍ່, ຫຼື ມີການຫຼົ້ມເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ໃຫ້ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າການສ້າງ metadata ຄືນໃໝ່ຈະສຳເລັດ ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Taskomatic ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກການຫຼົ້ມ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Taskomatic Problems"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Taskomatic"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, check the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`` file to determine if any "
"metadata regeneration processes are still running, or if a crash occurred."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ [path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າຂະບວນການສ້າງ metadata ຄືນໃໝ່ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ຫຼື ບໍ່, ຫຼື ມີການຫຼົ້ມເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:8
msgid "Restart taskomatic:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ taskomatic ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "service taskomatic restart\n"
msgstr "service taskomatic restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the Taskomatic log files, you can identify the section related to "
"metadata regeneration by looking for opening and closing lines that look "
"like this:"
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງ Taskomatic, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການສ້າງ metadata ຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຊອກຫາແຖວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດທີ່ຄືກັບແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,174 [Thread-584] INFO  "
"com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Generating new "
"repository metadata for channel "
"'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64'(sha256) 550 packages, 140 "
"errata\n"
msgstr "<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,174 [Thread-584] INFO  com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Generating new repository metadata for channel 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64'(sha256) 550 packages, 140 errata\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "...\n"
msgstr "...\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,704 [Thread-584] INFO  "
"com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Repository metadata "
"generation for 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64' finished in 4 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,704 [Thread-584] INFO  com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Repository metadata generation for 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64' finished in 4 seconds\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting {webui} Fails to Load"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ {webui} ໂຫຼດບໍ່ໄດ້"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the {webui} will not load after migration.  This is usually "
"caused by browser caching, if the new system has the same hostname and IP "
"address as the old system.  This duplication can confuse some browsers."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງ, {webui} ຈະບໍ່ໂຫຼດຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ. ສາເຫດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນມາຈາກ caching ຂອງບຣາວເຊີ, ຖ້າລະບົບໃໝ່ມີ hostname ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວກັນກັບລະບົບເກົ່າ. ຄວາມຊໍ້າຊ້ອນນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບຣາວເຊີບາງຕົວສັບສົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This issue is resolved by clearing the cache and reloading the page.  In "
"most browsers, you can do this quickly by pressing kbd:[Ctrl+F5]."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການລ້າງ cache ແລະ ໂຫຼດໜ້າໃໝ່. ໃນບຣາວເຊີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວໂດຍການກົດ kbd:[Ctrl+F5]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Changelogs"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ (Changelogs)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some packages have a long list of changelog entries.  This data is "
"downloaded by default, but it is not always useful information to keep.  In "
"order to limit the amount of changelog metadata which is downloaded and to "
"save disk space, you can put a limit on how many entries to keep on disk."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດບາງຢ່າງມີລາຍການບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຍາວຫຼາຍ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກດາວໂຫລດໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດສະເໝີໄປທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້. ເພື່ອຈຳກັດປະລິມານ metadata ຂອງ changelog ທີ່ຈະຖືກດາວໂຫລດ ແລະ ເພື່ອປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່ດິດ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳກັດຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນດິດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This configuration option is in the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file.  The parameter defaults to [systemitem]``20``; changing "
"this value to [systemitem]``0`` will provide an unlimited number of entries."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.max_changelog_entries = 20\n"
msgstr "java.max_changelog_entries = 20\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you set this parameter, it comes into effect only for new packages when "
"they are synchronized."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້, ມັນຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບແພັກເກດໃໝ່ໃນເວລາທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"After changing this parameter, restart services with ``spacewalk-service "
"restart``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You might like to delete and regenerate the cached data to remove older "
"data."
msgstr "ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການລຶບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນໃນ cache ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າອອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Deleting and regenerating cached data can take a long time.  Depending on "
"the number of channels you have and the amount of data to be deleted, it can "
"potentially take several hours.  The task is run in the background by "
"Taskomatic, so you can continue to use {productname} while the operation "
"completes, however you should expect some performance loss."
msgstr "ການລຶບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ cache ຄືນໃໝ່ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ທີ່ທ່ານມີ ແລະ ປະລິມານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະລຶບ, ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ. ວຽກນີ້ຈະຖືກລັນຢູ່ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງໂດຍ Taskomatic, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການເຮັດວຽກກຳລັງດຳເນີນການຢູ່, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ທ່ານຄວນຄຳນຶງເຖິງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງລະບົບທີ່ອາດຈະຫຼຸດລົງບາງສ່ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can delete and request a regeneration of cached data from the command "
"line:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບ ແລະ ຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ cache ຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-sql -i\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-sql -i\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:11
msgid "Then on the SQL database prompt, enter:"
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ SQL database, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DELETE FROM rhnPackageRepodata;\n"
"INSERT INTO rhnRepoRegenQueue (id, CHANNEL_LABEL, REASON, FORCE)\n"
"(SELECT sequence_nextval('rhn_repo_regen_queue_id_seq'),\n"
"        C.label,\n"
"        'cached data regeneration',\n"
"        'Y'\n"
"        FROM rhnChannel C);\n"
"\\q\n"
msgstr ""
"DELETE FROM rhnPackageRepodata;\n"
"INSERT INTO rhnRepoRegenQueue (id, CHANNEL_LABEL, REASON, FORCE)\n"
"(SELECT sequence_nextval('rhn_repo_regen_queue_id_seq'),\n"
"        C.label,\n"
"        'cached data regeneration',\n"
"        'Y'\n"
"        FROM rhnChannel C);\n"
"\\q\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Users)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} Administrators can add new users, grant permissions, and "
"deactivate or delete users.  If you are managing a large number of users, "
"you can assign users to system groups to manage permissions at a group "
"level.  You can also change the system defaults for the {webui}, including "
"language and theme defaults."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ສາມາດເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ມອບສິດທິ, ແລະ ປິດໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ລຶບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບເພື່ອຈັດການສິດທິໃນລະດັບກຸ່ມ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບ {webui}, ລວມທັງພາສາ ແລະ ຮູບແບບ (theme) ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Users`` menu is only available if you are logged in with the "
"{productname} administrator account."
msgstr "ເມນູ [guimenu]``Users`` ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບດ້ວຍບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To manage {productname} users, navigate to menu:Users[User List > All] to "
"see all users in your {productname} Server.  Each user in the list shows the "
"username, real name, assigned roles, the date the user last signed in, and "
"the current status of the user.  Click btn:``Create User`` to create a new "
"user account.  Click the username to go to the [guimenu]``User Details`` "
"page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To add new users to your organization, click btn:[Create User], complete the "
"details for the new user, and click btn:[Create Login]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create User], ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Login]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deactivate and Delete Accounts"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ການລຶບບັນຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can deactivate or delete user accounts if they are no longer required.  "
"Deactivated user accounts can be reactivated at any time.  Deleted user "
"accounts are not visible, and cannot be retrieved."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ລຶບບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫາກບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສາມາດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃໝ່ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. ສ່ວນບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກລຶບຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Users can deactivate their own accounts.  However, if users have an "
"administrator role, the role must be removed before the account can be "
"deactivated."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານບັນຊີຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີບົດບາດເປັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ, ບົດບາດນັ້ນຕ້ອງຖືກຍົກເລີກກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານບັນຊີໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Deactivated users cannot log in to the {productname} {webui} or schedule any "
"actions.  Actions scheduled by a user prior to their deactivation remain in "
"the action queue.  Deactivated users can be reactivated by {productname} "
"administrators."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າລະບົບ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຫຼື ຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການກະທຳໃດໆ. ການກະທຳທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນຄິວການກະທຳ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສາມາດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃໝ່ໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrator Roles"
msgstr "ບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Users can hold multiple administrator roles, and there can be more than one "
"user holding any administrator role at any time.  There must always be at "
"least one active {productname} Administrator."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດມີຫຼາຍບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໄດ້, ແລະ ສາມາດມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຄົນທີ່ມີບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ຈະຕ້ອງມີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄົນສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:12
msgid ""
"To change a user's administrator roles, except for the {productname} "
"Administrator role, navigate to menu:Users[User List > All], select the user "
"to change, and check or uncheck the administrator roles as required."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຍົກເວັ້ນບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[User List > All], ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນ, ແລະ ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To change a user's {productname} Administrator role, navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Users] and check or uncheck [guimenu]``{productname} Admin?`` as "
"required."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Users] ແລະ ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ [guimenu]``{productname} Admin?`` ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Administrator Role Permissions"
msgstr "ສິດທິຂອງບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Role Name | Description\n"
"| System Group User | Standard role associated with all users.\n"
"| {productname} Administrator | Can perform all functions, including "
"changing privileges of other users.\n"
"| Organization Administrator | Manages activation keys, configurations, "
"channels, and system groups.\n"
"| Activation Key Administrator | Manages activation keys.\n"
"| Image Administrator | Manages image profiles, builds, and stores.\n"
"| Configuration Administrator | Manages system configuration.\n"
"| Channel Administrator | Manages software channels, including making "
"channels globally subscribable, and creating new channels.\n"
"| System Group Administrator | Manages systems groups, including creating "
"and deleting system groups, adding clients to existing groups, and managing "
"user access to groups.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Permissions and Systems"
msgstr "ສິດທິຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you have created system groups to manage your clients, you can assign "
"groups to users for them to manage."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບເພື່ອຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດກຸ່ມໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຈັດການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:18
msgid ""
"To assign a user to a system group, navigate to menu:Users[User List], click "
"the username to edit, and go to the [guimenu]``System Groups`` tab.  Check "
"the groups to assign, and click btn:``Update Defaults``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:19
msgid ""
"You can also select one or more default system groups for a user.  When the "
"user registers a new client, it is assigned to the chosen system group by "
"default.  This allows the user to immediately access the newly registered "
"client."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກກຸ່ມລະບົບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໜຶ່ງກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ມັນຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຫາກໍ່ລົງທະບຽນໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#.  I really don't understand what this is. Need a sentence or two to explain it.  --LKB 2020-04-29
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To manage external groups, navigate to menu:Users[System Group "
"Configuration], and go to the [guimenu]``External Authentication`` tab.  "
"Click btn:[Create External Group] to create a new external group.  Give the "
"group a name, and assign it to the appropriate system group."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດການກຸ່ມພາຍນອກ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[System Group Configuration], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``External Authentication``. ຄລິກ btn:[Create External Group] ເພື່ອສ້າງກຸ່ມພາຍນອກໃໝ່. ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about system groups, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:22
msgid ""
"To see the individual clients a user can administer, navigate to "
"menu:Users[User List], click the username to edit, and go to the "
"[guimenu]``Systems`` tab.  To carry out bulk tasks, you can select clients "
"from the list to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດດູແລໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Systems``. ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ (bulk tasks), ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈາກລາຍການເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For more information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ system set manager, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users and Channel Permissions"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສິດທິຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can assign users to software channels within your organization either as "
"a subscriber that consumes content from channels, or as an administrator, "
"who can manage the channels themselves."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດມອບໝາຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທັງໃນນາມຜູ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscriber) ທີ່ຊົມໃຊ້ເນື້ອຫາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງ, ຫຼື ໃນນາມຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrator) ທີ່ສາມາດຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງເອງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:26
msgid ""
"To subscribe a user to a channel, navigate to menu:Users[User List], click "
"the username to edit, and go to the menu:Channel Permissions[Subscription] "
"tab.  Check the channels to assign, and click btn:``Update Permissions``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:27
msgid ""
"To grant a user channel management permissions, navigate to menu:Users[User "
"List], click the username to edit, and go to the menu:Channel "
"Permissions[Management] tab.  Check the channels to assign, and click "
"btn:``Update Permissions``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Some channels in the list might not be subscribable.  This is usually "
"because of the users administrator status, or the channels global settings."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງບາງຢ່າງໃນລາຍການອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນຍ້ອນສະຖານະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໂລກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Default Language"
msgstr "ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:30
msgid ""
"When you create a new user, you can choose which language to use for the "
"{webui}.  After a user has been created, you can change the language by "
"navigating to menu:Home[My Preferences]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກພາສາທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນ {webui} ໄດ້. ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນພາສາໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Home[My Preferences]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The default language is set in the ``rhn.conf`` configuration file.  To "
"change the default language, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file and "
"add or edit this line:"
msgstr "ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``rhn.conf``. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.locale = <LANGCODE>\n"
msgstr "web.locale = <LANGCODE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:33
msgid "If the parameter is not set, the default language is ``en_US``."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້, ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະແມ່ນ ``en_US``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:34
msgid "These languages are available in {productname}:"
msgstr "ພາສາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname}:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:35
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available Language Codes"
msgstr "ລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້"

